window.MG_LAZY_DATA["data/lazy/owner-courses/b039-a52b65ee96f3e34b.json"]={sha256:"a52b65ee96f3e34bea80fce57ac6f256025c0015fb4f081c5a8ec4ba5c2eefd1",value:{"id":"b039","title":"橋梁逐跨預鑄節塊架設","titleEn":"Span-by-span precast bridge erection","category":"structures","kind":"course","status":"guided","contentStatus":"reviewable-educational-curriculum","summary":"從簡支箱梁的正彎矩與體外預力需求出發，計算架橋機對橋墩的施工荷載，再處理乾接縫與環氧接縫、轉向塊與錨碇橫隔、架橋機推進穩定、整跨荷重轉換與預製場幾何控制，最後以鋼腱振動頻率、接縫監測與可更換性驗收交接，並以佛州 Long Key 橋、Seven Mile 橋與曼谷 Bang Na 高架道路為案例。","summaryEn":"Starting from the sagging moment and external prestress demand of a simple-span box girder, compute gantry construction loads on the piers, then handle dry and epoxy joints, deviators and anchorage diaphragms, gantry launching stability, whole-span load transfer and casting-yard geometry control, and finally accept and hand over with tendon vibration checks, joint monitoring and replaceability, using Florida's Long Key and Seven Mile bridges and Bangkok's Bang Na Expressway as cases.","scope":"依公開工程原理、官方資料與規範架構編寫的原創教學；步驟是可驗證的學習任務與假想算例，不是設計圖說、施工計畫、吊裝或張拉作業許可，也不是任何專案的設計文件。數值均為教學假設或公開資料，實際工程須由合格技師依規範與實測資料重新計算並簽證。","scopeEn":"Original teaching built from public engineering principles, official sources and code frameworks. Steps are verifiable learning tasks and hypothetical exercises, not design drawings, method statements, lifting or stressing permits, or any project's design documents. Numbers are teaching assumptions or public data; real work must be recalculated and certified by qualified engineers using codes and measured data.","subcategory":"st-bridge-construction","subcategoryTitle":"橋梁施工工法與大型架設","subcategoryTitleEn":"Bridge construction methods and heavy erection","learningTrack":"structures","learningSubdiscipline":"st-bridge-construction","learningTags":["structures","st-bridge-construction","segmental"],"architectureFamily":"segmental","architectureNodes":[["預製場短線台座","Short-line casting yard"],["節塊運輸與堆置","Segment transport and storage"],["架橋機與吊桿","Launching gantry and hangers"],["整跨節塊與接縫","Span segments and joints"],["體外鋼腱與轉向塊","External tendons and deviators"],["橋墩與永久支承","Piers and permanent bearings"]],"architectureEdges":[[0,1],[1,2],[2,3],[4,3],[3,5],[2,5]],"diagram":{"type":"segmental","labels":["預製場短線台座","節塊運輸與堆置","架橋機與吊桿","整跨節塊與接縫","體外鋼腱與轉向塊"],"labelsEn":["Short-line casting yard","Segment transport and storage","Launching gantry and hangers","Span segments and joints","External tendons and deviators"],"original":true,"notToScale":true},"workedExample":{"title":"原創假想算例與邊界","titleEn":"Original hypothetical example and boundaries","text":"工程規劃練習：一條 12.6 km 的高架橋採 42 m 簡支跨，共 12,600/42 = 300 跨，每跨 14 個節塊，總計 300×14 = 4,200 個節塊。若每部架橋機每 2.5 天完成一跨（含推進），單部需要 300×2.5 = 750 個工作天；投入 3 部架橋機則約 250 個工作天。供料需求為 3×14/2.5 = 16.8 個節塊／天，若每個短線台座每天產出 1 個節塊，至少需要 17 個台座，另加故障與養護餘裕。為吸收颱風或運輸中斷，堆置場若要儲備 30 天用量，需容納約 30×16.8 ≈ 504 個節塊。若架設循環變為 3 天／跨，總工期增為 300×3/3 = 300 天，日需求降為 3×14/3 = 14 個節塊。這說明逐跨工法的關鍵路徑常在預製與運輸，而不只是架設本身。數值為教學假設，不代表任何實際工程的計畫。","textEn":"Planning exercise: a 12.6 km viaduct with 42 m simple spans has 12,600/42 = 300 spans; at 14 segments per span it needs 300×14 = 4,200 segments. If each gantry completes a span every 2.5 days including launching, one gantry needs 300×2.5 = 750 working days; three gantries need about 250. Supply demand is 3×14/2.5 = 16.8 segments per day, so with one segment per short-line cell per day at least 17 cells are needed, plus margin for breakdowns and curing. To ride out a typhoon or transport stoppage with 30 days of buffer, the storage yard must hold about 30×16.8 ≈ 504 segments. If the erection cycle slips to 3 days per span, the duration grows to 300×3/3 = 300 days while daily demand drops to 3×14/3 = 14 segments. This shows that the critical path of span-by-span work often lies in casting and transport, not only in erection. Values are teaching assumptions, not the plan of any real project.","assumptions":"數值是本課自行設定的教學假設，不代表任何專案的設計值、量測值或規範允許值；改變系統邊界或荷載組合後必須重算。","assumptionsEn":"Inputs are teaching assumptions, not any project's design values, measurements or code allowances; recalculate after changing the system boundary or load combination.","sourceScope":"原創數值練習；來源支援公開原理與工程背景，不宣稱來源提供這組數據。","sourceScopeEn":"Original numerical exercise; sources support public principles and project context, not these numbers."},"depth":5,"languageCoverage":["zh-TW","en"],"simulationOnly":true,"educationEdition":13,"enrichmentVersion":13,"stages":[{"id":"b039-v13-s1","title":"工程背景、荷載與結構系統","titleEn":"Context, loads and structural system","description":"本階段聚焦「逐跨工法的結構系統與預力需求」與「架橋機與橋墩的施工期荷載」：先建立傳力機制與定量模型，再設計試驗驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"Structural system and prestress demand of span-by-span erection\" and \"Gantry construction loads on the piers\": build the load path and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"b039-v13-01","title":"逐跨工法的結構系統與預力需求：機制與傳力路徑","titleEn":"Structural system and prestress demand of span-by-span erection: mechanism and load path","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-asbi-segmental-construction","v13s-pci-bang-na-2000","v13s-pci-muller-bridge-engineer-2006","v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-wiki-seven-mile-bridge"],"prerequisiteIds":[],"objective":"說明「整跨箱梁與體外鋼腱」如何影響橋梁逐跨預鑄節塊架設的受力、變形或耐久表現，並畫出荷載的來源、傳遞路徑與支承邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Whole-span box and external tendons” governs force, deformation or durability in “Span-by-span precast bridge erection”, and map where loads come from, how they travel and where they are supported.","instruction":"逐跨工法把一整跨的預鑄節塊（常見 10 至 14 塊）同時懸吊或擱置在架橋機或下承桁架上，調整線形後一次張拉縱向鋼腱，使整跨立刻成為能自承重的簡支梁，再把架橋機推到下一跨。因為所有節塊在張拉前都由臨時結構承托，接縫在施工期不需承受懸臂彎矩，箱梁可以用等高度斷面，最適合跨度約 30 至 45 m、跨數很多的長距離高架橋。鋼腱多採體外配置，沿箱內由錨碇橫隔經轉向塊折線布設，近似拋物線的偏心抵抗跨中正彎矩。 師傅任務：以自由體圖或傳力路徑圖畫出荷載如何經過「整跨箱梁與體外鋼腱」傳到支承或基礎，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Span-by-span erection hangs or rests a whole span of precast segments, commonly 10 to 14, on an overhead gantry or underslung truss, aligns them, then stresses the longitudinal tendons in one operation so the span immediately becomes a self-supporting simple beam before the gantry moves on. Because all segments are carried by temporary works until stressing, the joints never carry cantilever moment during construction and the box can have constant depth, ideal for long viaducts with many spans of about 30 to 45 m. Tendons are usually external, running inside the box from anchorage diaphragm to deviators in a polygonal profile whose eccentricity approximates a parabola to resist midspan sagging moment. Mentor task: draw a free-body or load-path diagram showing how loads pass through “Whole-span box and external tendons” to the supports or foundation, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：簡支跨 L = 42 m、自重 w = 180 kN/m：M_DL = wL²/8 = 39,690 kN·m；加鋪面 50 kN/m 的 11,025 kN·m 與活載 12,000 kN·m，合計 M = 62,715 kN·m。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Simple span L = 42 m, self-weight w = 180 kN/m: M_DL = wL²/8 = 39,690 kN·m; adding 11,025 kN·m from 50 kN/m surfacing and 12,000 kN·m of live load gives M = 62,715 kN·m.","failure":"常見誤解：「逐跨架設的節塊接縫在營運時可以像鋼筋混凝土一樣容許開裂。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在傳力圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Joints in span-by-span segmental spans may crack in service just like reinforced concrete.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your load-path diagram where it breaks down.","check":"傳力圖標明「整跨箱梁與體外鋼腱」的荷載來源、傳遞路徑與支承；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The load-path diagram shows load sources, path and supports for “Whole-span box and external tendons”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b039-v13-01-k1","title":"逐跨工法的結構系統與預力需求","titleEn":"Structural system and prestress demand of span-by-span erection","text":"逐跨工法把一整跨的預鑄節塊（常見 10 至 14 塊）同時懸吊或擱置在架橋機或下承桁架上，調整線形後一次張拉縱向鋼腱，使整跨立刻成為能自承重的簡支梁，再把架橋機推到下一跨。因為所有節塊在張拉前都由臨時結構承托，接縫在施工期不需承受懸臂彎矩，箱梁可以用等高度斷面，最適合跨度約 30 至 45 m、跨數很多的長距離高架橋。","textEn":"Span-by-span erection hangs or rests a whole span of precast segments, commonly 10 to 14, on an overhead gantry or underslung truss, aligns them, then stresses the longitudinal tendons in one operation so the span immediately becomes a self-supporting simple beam before the gantry moves on. Because all segments are carried by temporary works until stressing, the joints never carry cantilever moment during construction and the box can have constant depth, ideal for long viaducts with many spans of about 30 to 45 m.","sourceIds":["v13s-asbi-segmental-construction","v13s-pci-bang-na-2000","v13s-pci-muller-bridge-engineer-2006","v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-wiki-seven-mile-bridge"]},{"id":"b039-v13-01-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：逐跨架設的節塊接縫在營運時可以像鋼筋混凝土一樣容許開裂。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Joints in span-by-span segmental spans may crack in service just like reinforced concrete. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v13s-asbi-segmental-construction","v13s-pci-bang-na-2000","v13s-pci-muller-bridge-engineer-2006","v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-wiki-seven-mile-bridge"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「逐跨工法的結構系統與預力需求」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Structural system and prestress demand of span-by-span erection\" is correct?","options":["逐跨架設的節塊接縫在營運時可以像鋼筋混凝土一樣容許開裂。","逐跨工法把一整跨的預鑄節塊（常見 10 至 14 塊）同時懸吊或擱置在架橋機或下承桁架上，調整線形後一次張拉縱向鋼腱，使整跨立刻成為能自承重的簡支梁，再把架橋機推到下一跨。","架橋機的荷重只是暫時的，橋墩照營運荷載設計就足夠。"],"optionsEn":["Joints in span-by-span segmental spans may crack in service just like reinforced concrete.","Span-by-span erection hangs or rests a whole span of precast segments, commonly 10 to 14, on an overhead gantry or underslung truss, aligns them, then stresses the longitudinal tendons in one operation so the span immediately becomes a self-supporting simple beam before the gantry moves on.","Gantry loads are only temporary, so piers designed for service loads are always sufficient."],"answer":1,"explanation":"逐跨工法把一整跨的預鑄節塊（常見 10 至 14 塊）同時懸吊或擱置在架橋機或下承桁架上，調整線形後一次張拉縱向鋼腱，使整跨立刻成為能自承重的簡支梁，再把架橋機推到下一跨。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Span-by-span erection hangs or rests a whole span of precast segments, commonly 10 to 14, on an overhead gantry or underslung truss, aligns them, then stresses the longitudinal tendons in one operation so the span immediately becomes a self-supporting simple beam before the gantry moves on. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":1,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":1},{"id":"b039-v13-02","title":"逐跨工法的結構系統與預力需求：定量估算","titleEn":"Structural system and prestress demand of span-by-span erection: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-asbi-segmental-construction","v13s-pci-bang-na-2000","v13s-pci-muller-bridge-engineer-2006","v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-wiki-seven-mile-bridge"],"prerequisiteIds":["b039-v13-01"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「整跨箱梁與體外鋼腱」的關鍵量，並判斷跨度、荷載、溫度或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Whole-span box and external tendons” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when span, load, temperature or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：簡支跨 L = 42 m、自重 w = 180 kN/m：M_DL = wL²/8 = 39,690 kN·m；加鋪面 50 kN/m 的 11,025 kN·m 與活載 12,000 kN·m，合計 M = 62,715 kN·m。斷面 A = 7.2 m²、S_b = 4.0 m³、跨中偏心 e = 1.0 m，底緣保留 0.7 MPa 壓應力：P ≥ (62,715/4.0 + 700)/(1/7.2 + 1.0/4.0) ≈ 42,120 kN，取 12 束 × 3,600 kN = 43,200 kN。數值為教學假設。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Simple span L = 42 m, self-weight w = 180 kN/m: M_DL = wL²/8 = 39,690 kN·m; adding 11,025 kN·m from 50 kN/m surfacing and 12,000 kN·m of live load gives M = 62,715 kN·m. With A = 7.2 m², S_b = 4.0 m³, midspan eccentricity e = 1.0 m and 0.7 MPa residual bottom compression, P ≥ (62,715/4.0 + 700)/(1/7.2 + 1.0/4.0) ≈ 42,120 kN; use 12 tendons × 3,600 kN = 43,200 kN. Values are teaching assumptions. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：以施工階段模型檢查三個狀態：節塊懸吊於架橋機（梁體無預力）、張拉完成後架橋機卸載（自重加預力）、營運滿載（含鋪面與活載），每個狀態列出每一接縫上下緣應力，確認接縫在所有使用狀態都維持設計規定的殘餘壓應力。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Check three states in a construction-stage model: segments hanging from the gantry with no prestress, after stressing with the gantry unloaded (self-weight plus prestress), and full service load with surfacing and live load, listing top and bottom stresses at every joint and confirming that each joint keeps the specified residual compression in all service states.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b039-v13-02-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"簡支跨 L = 42 m、自重 w = 180 kN/m：M_DL = wL²/8 = 39,690 kN·m；加鋪面 50 kN/m 的 11,025 kN·m 與活載 12,000 kN·m，合計 M = 62,715 kN·m。斷面 A = 7.2 m²、S_b = 4.0 m³、跨中偏心 e = 1.0 m，底緣保留 0.7 MPa 壓應力：P ≥ (62,715/4.0 + 700)/(1/7.2 + 1.0/4.0) ≈ 42,120 kN，取 12 束 × 3,600 kN = 43,200 kN。數值為教學假設。","textEn":"Simple span L = 42 m, self-weight w = 180 kN/m: M_DL = wL²/8 = 39,690 kN·m; adding 11,025 kN·m from 50 kN/m surfacing and 12,000 kN·m of live load gives M = 62,715 kN·m. With A = 7.2 m², S_b = 4.0 m³, midspan eccentricity e = 1.0 m and 0.7 MPa residual bottom compression, P ≥ (62,715/4.0 + 700)/(1/7.2 + 1.0/4.0) ≈ 42,120 kN; use 12 tendons × 3,600 kN = 43,200 kN. Values are teaching assumptions.","sourceIds":["v13s-asbi-segmental-construction","v13s-pci-bang-na-2000","v13s-pci-muller-bridge-engineer-2006","v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-wiki-seven-mile-bridge"]},{"id":"b039-v13-02-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v13s-asbi-segmental-construction","v13s-pci-bang-na-2000","v13s-pci-muller-bridge-engineer-2006","v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-wiki-seven-mile-bridge"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「逐跨工法的結構系統與預力需求」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Structural system and prestress demand of span-by-span erection\", which statement holds?","options":["體外鋼腱不埋在混凝土裡，所以轉向塊只需要很少的鋼筋。","張拉完成後只要拆除吊桿，荷重自然會平均傳到四個支承。","簡支跨 L = 42 m、自重 w = 180 kN/m：M_DL = wL²/8 = 39,690 kN·m。"],"optionsEn":["Because external tendons are not embedded, deviators need very little reinforcement.","After stressing, removing the hangers automatically shares the load equally among the four bearings.","Simple span L = 42 m, self-weight w = 180 kN/m: M_DL = wL²/8 = 39,690 kN·m."],"answer":2,"explanation":"簡支跨 L = 42 m、自重 w = 180 kN/m：M_DL = wL²/8 = 39,690 kN·m；加鋪面 50 kN/m 的 11,025 kN·m 與活載 12,000 kN·m，合計 M = 62,715 kN·m。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Simple span L = 42 m, self-weight w = 180 kN/m: M_DL = wL²/8 = 39,690 kN·m; adding 11,025 kN·m from 50 kN/m surfacing and 12,000 kN·m of live load gives M = 62,715 kN·m. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":1,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":2},{"id":"b039-v13-03","title":"逐跨工法的結構系統與預力需求：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Structural system and prestress demand of span-by-span erection: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-asbi-segmental-construction","v13s-pci-bang-na-2000","v13s-pci-muller-bridge-engineer-2006","v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-wiki-seven-mile-bridge"],"prerequisiteIds":["b039-v13-02"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「整跨箱梁與體外鋼腱」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Whole-span box and external tendons” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"以施工階段模型檢查三個狀態：節塊懸吊於架橋機（梁體無預力）、張拉完成後架橋機卸載（自重加預力）、營運滿載（含鋪面與活載），每個狀態列出每一接縫上下緣應力，確認接縫在所有使用狀態都維持設計規定的殘餘壓應力。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Check three states in a construction-stage model: segments hanging from the gantry with no prestress, after stressing with the gantry unloaded (self-weight plus prestress), and full service load with surfacing and live load, listing top and bottom stresses at every joint and confirming that each joint keeps the specified residual compression in all service states. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：設計圖說應明列每一跨的節塊編號、鋼腱編號與張拉順序，並註明接縫殘餘壓應力的設計值，作為施工與日後評估的共同基準。","observationEn":"Site practice: Drawings should list segment numbers, tendon numbers and stressing order for every span and state the design residual joint compression, as a shared basis for construction and later assessment.","failure":"注意干擾：若把預鑄節塊箱梁當作一般連續鋼筋混凝土梁設計，忽略接縫處沒有連續鋼筋，活載下跨中接縫會張開，雨水與鹽分直接進入箱內，體外鋼腱錨頭與轉向塊加速腐蝕。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、日照與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: Designing a precast segmental box like an ordinary reinforced girder, ignoring that no reinforcement crosses the joints, lets midspan joints open under live load so rain and salt enter the box and accelerate corrosion at external tendon anchors and deviators. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, sunshine and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b039-v13-03-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"以施工階段模型檢查三個狀態：節塊懸吊於架橋機（梁體無預力）、張拉完成後架橋機卸載（自重加預力）、營運滿載（含鋪面與活載），每個狀態列出每一接縫上下緣應力，確認接縫在所有使用狀態都維持設計規定的殘餘壓應力。","textEn":"Check three states in a construction-stage model: segments hanging from the gantry with no prestress, after stressing with the gantry unloaded (self-weight plus prestress), and full service load with surfacing and live load, listing top and bottom stresses at every joint and confirming that each joint keeps the specified residual compression in all service states.","sourceIds":["v13s-asbi-segmental-construction","v13s-pci-bang-na-2000","v13s-pci-muller-bridge-engineer-2006","v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-wiki-seven-mile-bridge"]},{"id":"b039-v13-03-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"設計圖說應明列每一跨的節塊編號、鋼腱編號與張拉順序，並註明接縫殘餘壓應力的設計值，作為施工與日後評估的共同基準。","textEn":"Drawings should list segment numbers, tendon numbers and stressing order for every span and state the design residual joint compression, as a shared basis for construction and later assessment.","sourceIds":["v13s-asbi-segmental-construction","v13s-pci-bang-na-2000","v13s-pci-muller-bridge-engineer-2006","v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-wiki-seven-mile-bridge"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「逐跨工法的結構系統與預力需求」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Structural system and prestress demand of span-by-span erection\"?","options":["以施工階段模型檢查三個狀態：節塊懸吊於架橋機（梁體無預力）、張拉完成後架橋機卸載（自重加預力）、營運滿載（含鋪面與活載），每個狀態列出每一接縫上下緣應力，確認接縫在所有使用狀態都維持設計規定的殘餘壓應力。","量測時不必記錄溫度、日照、風與施工荷重，因為它們不會影響結果。","體外鋼腱張拉完成後力量不會改變，所以不需要再量測。"],"optionsEn":["Check three states in a construction-stage model: segments hanging from the gantry with no prestress, after stressing with the gantry unloaded (self-weight plus prestress), and full service load with surfacing and live load, listing top and bottom stresses at every joint and confirming that each joint keeps the specified residual compression in all service states.","Temperature, sunshine, wind and construction loads need not be recorded because they cannot affect the result.","Once stressed, an external tendon's force never changes, so it need not be measured again."],"answer":0,"explanation":"以施工階段模型檢查三個狀態：節塊懸吊於架橋機（梁體無預力）、張拉完成後架橋機卸載（自重加預力）、營運滿載（含鋪面與活載），每個狀態列出每一接縫上下緣應力，確認接縫在所有使用狀態都維持設計規定的殘餘壓應力。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Check three states in a construction-stage model: segments hanging from the gantry with no prestress, after stressing with the gantry unloaded (self-weight plus prestress), and full service load with surfacing and live load, listing top and bottom stresses at every joint and confirming that each joint keeps the specified residual compression in all service states. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":1,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":3},{"id":"b039-v13-04","title":"逐跨工法的結構系統與預力需求：失效診斷","titleEn":"Structural system and prestress demand of span-by-span erection: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-asbi-segmental-construction","v13s-pci-bang-na-2000","v13s-pci-muller-bridge-engineer-2006","v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-wiki-seven-mile-bridge"],"prerequisiteIds":["b039-v13-03"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「整跨箱梁與體外鋼腱」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Whole-span box and external tendons” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"若把預鑄節塊箱梁當作一般連續鋼筋混凝土梁設計，忽略接縫處沒有連續鋼筋，活載下跨中接縫會張開，雨水與鹽分直接進入箱內，體外鋼腱錨頭與轉向塊加速腐蝕。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"Designing a precast segmental box like an ordinary reinforced girder, ignoring that no reinforcement crosses the joints, lets midspan joints open under live load so rain and salt enter the box and accelerate corrosion at external tendon anchors and deviators. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：鋼腱多採體外配置，沿箱內由錨碇橫隔經轉向塊折線布設，近似拋物線的偏心抵抗跨中正彎矩。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Tendons are usually external, running inside the box from anchorage diaphragm to deviators in a polygonal profile whose eccentricity approximates a parabola to resist midspan sagging moment.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「逐跨架設的節塊接縫在營運時可以像鋼筋混凝土一樣容許開裂。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Joints in span-by-span segmental spans may crack in service just like reinforced concrete.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b039-v13-04-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"若把預鑄節塊箱梁當作一般連續鋼筋混凝土梁設計，忽略接縫處沒有連續鋼筋，活載下跨中接縫會張開，雨水與鹽分直接進入箱內，體外鋼腱錨頭與轉向塊加速腐蝕。","textEn":"Designing a precast segmental box like an ordinary reinforced girder, ignoring that no reinforcement crosses the joints, lets midspan joints open under live load so rain and salt enter the box and accelerate corrosion at external tendon anchors and deviators.","sourceIds":["v13s-asbi-segmental-construction","v13s-pci-bang-na-2000","v13s-pci-muller-bridge-engineer-2006","v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-wiki-seven-mile-bridge"]},{"id":"b039-v13-04-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v13s-asbi-segmental-construction","v13s-pci-bang-na-2000","v13s-pci-muller-bridge-engineer-2006","v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-wiki-seven-mile-bridge"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「逐跨工法的結構系統與預力需求」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Structural system and prestress demand of span-by-span erection\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["所有異常都來自施工人員失誤，設計與細部不需要檢討。","若把預鑄節塊箱梁當作一般連續鋼筋混凝土梁設計，忽略接縫處沒有連續鋼筋，活載下跨中接縫會張開，雨水與鹽分直接進入箱內，體外鋼腱錨頭與轉向塊加速腐蝕。","架橋機的荷重只是暫時的，橋墩照營運荷載設計就足夠。"],"optionsEn":["Every anomaly is a workmanship error, so design and detailing never need review.","Designing a precast segmental box like an ordinary reinforced girder, ignoring that no reinforcement crosses the joints, lets midspan joints open under live load so rain and salt enter the box and accelerate corrosion at external tendon anchors and deviators.","Gantry loads are only temporary, so piers designed for service loads are always sufficient."],"answer":1,"explanation":"若把預鑄節塊箱梁當作一般連續鋼筋混凝土梁設計，忽略接縫處沒有連續鋼筋，活載下跨中接縫會張開，雨水與鹽分直接進入箱內，體外鋼腱錨頭與轉向塊加速腐蝕。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Designing a precast segmental box like an ordinary reinforced girder, ignoring that no reinforcement crosses the joints, lets midspan joints open under live load so rain and salt enter the box and accelerate corrosion at external tendon anchors and deviators. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":1,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":4},{"id":"b039-v13-05","title":"架橋機與橋墩的施工期荷載：機制與傳力路徑","titleEn":"Gantry construction loads on the piers: mechanism and load path","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-asbi-segmental-construction","v13s-pci-bang-na-2000","v13s-pci-muller-bridge-engineer-2006","v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-wiki-seven-mile-bridge"],"prerequisiteIds":["b039-v13-04"],"objective":"說明「架橋機支腿反力」如何影響橋梁逐跨預鑄節塊架設的受力、變形或耐久表現，並畫出荷載的來源、傳遞路徑與支承邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Gantry leg reactions” governs force, deformation or durability in “Span-by-span precast bridge erection”, and map where loads come from, how they travel and where they are supported.","instruction":"整跨節塊在張拉前全部重量經由架橋機傳到前後兩座橋墩，架橋機自重也一併加上；支腿通常放在墩帽或已完成箱梁的端部，與墩柱軸線有偏心，墩柱在施工期承受營運時不會出現的單側彎矩。架橋機推進時重心沿縱向移動，風力又作用在高聳的主桁與節塊上，所以墩帽承壓、墩柱彎矩、基礎與支承臨時鎖定都要以施工荷載逐一檢核，而不是只套用營運荷載組合。 師傅任務：以自由體圖或傳力路徑圖畫出荷載如何經過「架橋機支腿反力」傳到支承或基礎，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Before stressing, the entire weight of a span of segments, plus the gantry's own weight, passes through the gantry to the two piers; legs usually sit on the pier cap or on the end of the completed girder, eccentric to the column axis, so the column carries one-sided bending that never occurs in service. As the gantry launches, its centre of gravity moves along the bridge and wind acts on the tall girders and hanging segments, so pier-cap bearing, column bending, foundations and temporary bearing locks must each be checked for construction loads rather than service combinations alone. Mentor task: draw a free-body or load-path diagram showing how loads pass through “Gantry leg reactions” to the supports or foundation, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：一跨節塊 W = 180×42 = 7,560 kN，架橋機在該跨的自重 4,000 kN，兩支腿平均反力 R = (7,560 + 4,000)/2 = 5,780 kN；支腿距墩軸偏心 1.2 m 時墩柱施工彎矩 M = 5,780×1.2 ≈ 6,936 kN·m，須與墩柱設計彎矩與基礎承載比較。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: One span of segments weighs W = 180×42 = 7,560 kN and the gantry contributes 4,000 kN over that span, so each of the two legs carries on average R = (7,560 + 4,000)/2 = 5,780 kN; with a 1.2 m leg eccentricity from the pier axis the construction moment in the column is M = 5,780×1.2 ≈ 6,936 kN·m, to be compared with the column and foundation capacity.","failure":"常見誤解：「架橋機的荷重只是暫時的，橋墩照營運荷載設計就足夠。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在傳力圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Gantry loads are only temporary, so piers designed for service loads are always sufficient.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your load-path diagram where it breaks down.","check":"傳力圖標明「架橋機支腿反力」的荷載來源、傳遞路徑與支承；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The load-path diagram shows load sources, path and supports for “Gantry leg reactions”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b039-v13-05-k1","title":"架橋機與橋墩的施工期荷載","titleEn":"Gantry construction loads on the piers","text":"整跨節塊在張拉前全部重量經由架橋機傳到前後兩座橋墩，架橋機自重也一併加上；支腿通常放在墩帽或已完成箱梁的端部，與墩柱軸線有偏心，墩柱在施工期承受營運時不會出現的單側彎矩。架橋機推進時重心沿縱向移動，風力又作用在高聳的主桁與節塊上，所以墩帽承壓、墩柱彎矩、基礎與支承臨時鎖定都要以施工荷載逐一檢核，而不是只套用營運荷載組合。","textEn":"Before stressing, the entire weight of a span of segments, plus the gantry's own weight, passes through the gantry to the two piers; legs usually sit on the pier cap or on the end of the completed girder, eccentric to the column axis, so the column carries one-sided bending that never occurs in service. As the gantry launches, its centre of gravity moves along the bridge and wind acts on the tall girders and hanging segments, so pier-cap bearing, column bending, foundations and temporary bearing locks must each be checked for construction loads rather than service combinations alone.","sourceIds":["v13s-asbi-segmental-construction","v13s-pci-bang-na-2000","v13s-pci-muller-bridge-engineer-2006","v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-wiki-seven-mile-bridge"]},{"id":"b039-v13-05-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：架橋機的荷重只是暫時的，橋墩照營運荷載設計就足夠。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Gantry loads are only temporary, so piers designed for service loads are always sufficient. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v13s-asbi-segmental-construction","v13s-pci-bang-na-2000","v13s-pci-muller-bridge-engineer-2006","v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-wiki-seven-mile-bridge"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「架橋機與橋墩的施工期荷載」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Gantry construction loads on the piers\" is correct?","options":["架橋機的荷重只是暫時的，橋墩照營運荷載設計就足夠。","乾接縫只是少塗一層環氧，結構行為與環氧接縫完全相同。","整跨節塊在張拉前全部重量經由架橋機傳到前後兩座橋墩，架橋機自重也一併加上。"],"optionsEn":["Gantry loads are only temporary, so piers designed for service loads are always sufficient.","A dry joint is just an epoxy joint without the epoxy and behaves identically.","Before stressing, the entire weight of a span of segments, plus the gantry's own weight, passes through the gantry to the two piers."],"answer":2,"explanation":"整跨節塊在張拉前全部重量經由架橋機傳到前後兩座橋墩，架橋機自重也一併加上；支腿通常放在墩帽或已完成箱梁的端部，與墩柱軸線有偏心，墩柱在施工期承受營運時不會出現的單側彎矩。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Before stressing, the entire weight of a span of segments, plus the gantry's own weight, passes through the gantry to the two piers; legs usually sit on the pier cap or on the end of the completed girder, eccentric to the column axis, so the column carries one-sided bending that never occurs in service. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":2,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":5},{"id":"b039-v13-06","title":"架橋機與橋墩的施工期荷載：定量估算","titleEn":"Gantry construction loads on the piers: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-asbi-segmental-construction","v13s-pci-bang-na-2000","v13s-pci-muller-bridge-engineer-2006","v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-wiki-seven-mile-bridge"],"prerequisiteIds":["b039-v13-05"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「架橋機支腿反力」的關鍵量，並判斷跨度、荷載、溫度或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Gantry leg reactions” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when span, load, temperature or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：一跨節塊 W = 180×42 = 7,560 kN，架橋機在該跨的自重 4,000 kN，兩支腿平均反力 R = (7,560 + 4,000)/2 = 5,780 kN；支腿距墩軸偏心 1.2 m 時墩柱施工彎矩 M = 5,780×1.2 ≈ 6,936 kN·m，須與墩柱設計彎矩與基礎承載比較。數值為教學假設。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: One span of segments weighs W = 180×42 = 7,560 kN and the gantry contributes 4,000 kN over that span, so each of the two legs carries on average R = (7,560 + 4,000)/2 = 5,780 kN; with a 1.2 m leg eccentricity from the pier axis the construction moment in the column is M = 5,780×1.2 ≈ 6,936 kN·m, to be compared with the column and foundation capacity. Values are teaching assumptions. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：架橋機供應商須提供各工況（空載推進、懸吊整跨、張拉、颱風停機）的支腿反力表，由橋梁設計單位對照墩帽、墩柱與基礎容量逐項確認；首跨架設時在支腿下設荷重計或以油壓讀值監測實際反力，與表列值比較。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: The gantry supplier must provide leg-reaction tables for each case (empty launch, full span hanging, stressing, storm parking), which the bridge designer checks against pier-cap, column and foundation capacity item by item; on the first span, monitor real reactions with load cells or hydraulic readings under the legs and compare with the table.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b039-v13-06-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"一跨節塊 W = 180×42 = 7,560 kN，架橋機在該跨的自重 4,000 kN，兩支腿平均反力 R = (7,560 + 4,000)/2 = 5,780 kN；支腿距墩軸偏心 1.2 m 時墩柱施工彎矩 M = 5,780×1.2 ≈ 6,936 kN·m，須與墩柱設計彎矩與基礎承載比較。數值為教學假設。","textEn":"One span of segments weighs W = 180×42 = 7,560 kN and the gantry contributes 4,000 kN over that span, so each of the two legs carries on average R = (7,560 + 4,000)/2 = 5,780 kN; with a 1.2 m leg eccentricity from the pier axis the construction moment in the column is M = 5,780×1.2 ≈ 6,936 kN·m, to be compared with the column and foundation capacity. Values are teaching assumptions.","sourceIds":["v13s-asbi-segmental-construction","v13s-pci-bang-na-2000","v13s-pci-muller-bridge-engineer-2006","v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-wiki-seven-mile-bridge"]},{"id":"b039-v13-06-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v13s-asbi-segmental-construction","v13s-pci-bang-na-2000","v13s-pci-muller-bridge-engineer-2006","v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-wiki-seven-mile-bridge"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「架橋機與橋墩的施工期荷載」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Gantry construction loads on the piers\", which statement holds?","options":["一跨節塊 W = 180×42 = 7,560 kN，架橋機在該跨的自重 4,000 kN，兩支腿平均反力 R = (7,560 + 4,000)/2 = 5,780 kN。","架橋機本身很重，所以推進時不可能傾覆。","預製場的模板精度夠高，就不需要逐塊量測幾何。"],"optionsEn":["One span of segments weighs W = 180×42 = 7,560 kN and the gantry contributes 4,000 kN over that span, so each of the two legs carries on average R = (7,560 + 4,000)/2 = 5,780 kN.","A gantry is so heavy that it cannot overturn while launching.","If the yard forms are accurate enough, segment geometry need not be surveyed one by one."],"answer":0,"explanation":"一跨節塊 W = 180×42 = 7,560 kN，架橋機在該跨的自重 4,000 kN，兩支腿平均反力 R = (7,560 + 4,000)/2 = 5,780 kN；支腿距墩軸偏心 1.2 m 時墩柱施工彎矩 M = 5,780×1.2 ≈ 6,936 kN·m，須與墩柱設計彎矩與基礎承載比較。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"One span of segments weighs W = 180×42 = 7,560 kN and the gantry contributes 4,000 kN over that span, so each of the two legs carries on average R = (7,560 + 4,000)/2 = 5,780 kN; with a 1.2 m leg eccentricity from the pier axis the construction moment in the column is M = 5,780×1.2 ≈ 6,936 kN·m, to be compared with the column and foundation capacity. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":2,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":6},{"id":"b039-v13-07","title":"架橋機與橋墩的施工期荷載：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Gantry construction loads on the piers: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-asbi-segmental-construction","v13s-pci-bang-na-2000","v13s-pci-muller-bridge-engineer-2006","v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-wiki-seven-mile-bridge"],"prerequisiteIds":["b039-v13-06"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「架橋機支腿反力」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Gantry leg reactions” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"架橋機供應商須提供各工況（空載推進、懸吊整跨、張拉、颱風停機）的支腿反力表，由橋梁設計單位對照墩帽、墩柱與基礎容量逐項確認；首跨架設時在支腿下設荷重計或以油壓讀值監測實際反力，與表列值比較。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"The gantry supplier must provide leg-reaction tables for each case (empty launch, full span hanging, stressing, storm parking), which the bridge designer checks against pier-cap, column and foundation capacity item by item; on the first span, monitor real reactions with load cells or hydraulic readings under the legs and compare with the table. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：把架橋機支腿位置、最大反力與停機條件（例如風速上限）寫入橋墩設計說明與施工計畫，任何更換架橋機或改變支腿位置都需重新送審。","observationEn":"Site practice: Write gantry leg positions, maximum reactions and parking conditions, such as a wind-speed limit, into the pier design notes and the construction plan, and require resubmission for any change of gantry or leg position.","failure":"注意干擾：支腿落在墩帽邊緣或未經設計的位置，可能壓碎墩帽混凝土或使支承墊石開裂；若颱風停機時未鎖定架橋機並降低懸吊荷重，側風可能使架橋機橫移甚至倒塌，砸毀已完成的跨。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、日照與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: Legs landing near the edge of a pier cap or at an undesigned position can crush the cap concrete or crack bearing plinths; if the gantry is not locked and unloaded when parked for a typhoon, cross-wind can slide or topple it onto completed spans. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, sunshine and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b039-v13-07-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"架橋機供應商須提供各工況（空載推進、懸吊整跨、張拉、颱風停機）的支腿反力表，由橋梁設計單位對照墩帽、墩柱與基礎容量逐項確認；首跨架設時在支腿下設荷重計或以油壓讀值監測實際反力，與表列值比較。","textEn":"The gantry supplier must provide leg-reaction tables for each case (empty launch, full span hanging, stressing, storm parking), which the bridge designer checks against pier-cap, column and foundation capacity item by item; on the first span, monitor real reactions with load cells or hydraulic readings under the legs and compare with the table.","sourceIds":["v13s-asbi-segmental-construction","v13s-pci-bang-na-2000","v13s-pci-muller-bridge-engineer-2006","v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-wiki-seven-mile-bridge"]},{"id":"b039-v13-07-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"把架橋機支腿位置、最大反力與停機條件（例如風速上限）寫入橋墩設計說明與施工計畫，任何更換架橋機或改變支腿位置都需重新送審。","textEn":"Write gantry leg positions, maximum reactions and parking conditions, such as a wind-speed limit, into the pier design notes and the construction plan, and require resubmission for any change of gantry or leg position.","sourceIds":["v13s-asbi-segmental-construction","v13s-pci-bang-na-2000","v13s-pci-muller-bridge-engineer-2006","v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-wiki-seven-mile-bridge"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「架橋機與橋墩的施工期荷載」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Gantry construction loads on the piers\"?","options":["沿用另一座橋或另一棟建築的量測結果，就可視為本工程已完成驗證。","架橋機供應商須提供各工況（空載推進、懸吊整跨、張拉、颱風停機）的支腿反力表，由橋梁設計單位對照墩帽、墩柱與基礎容量逐項確認。","體外鋼腱有 HDPE 套管保護，所以不會腐蝕。"],"optionsEn":["Reusing results from another bridge or building counts as verifying this structure.","The gantry supplier must provide leg-reaction tables for each case (empty launch, full span hanging, stressing, storm parking), which the bridge designer checks against pier-cap, column and foundation capacity item by item.","External tendons in HDPE sheaths cannot corrode."],"answer":1,"explanation":"架橋機供應商須提供各工況（空載推進、懸吊整跨、張拉、颱風停機）的支腿反力表，由橋梁設計單位對照墩帽、墩柱與基礎容量逐項確認；首跨架設時在支腿下設荷重計或以油壓讀值監測實際反力，與表列值比較。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"The gantry supplier must provide leg-reaction tables for each case (empty launch, full span hanging, stressing, storm parking), which the bridge designer checks against pier-cap, column and foundation capacity item by item; on the first span, monitor real reactions with load cells or hydraulic readings under the legs and compare with the table. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":2,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":7},{"id":"b039-v13-08","title":"架橋機與橋墩的施工期荷載：失效診斷","titleEn":"Gantry construction loads on the piers: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-asbi-segmental-construction","v13s-pci-bang-na-2000","v13s-pci-muller-bridge-engineer-2006","v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-wiki-seven-mile-bridge"],"prerequisiteIds":["b039-v13-07"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「架橋機支腿反力」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Gantry leg reactions” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"支腿落在墩帽邊緣或未經設計的位置，可能壓碎墩帽混凝土或使支承墊石開裂；若颱風停機時未鎖定架橋機並降低懸吊荷重，側風可能使架橋機橫移甚至倒塌，砸毀已完成的跨。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"Legs landing near the edge of a pier cap or at an undesigned position can crush the cap concrete or crack bearing plinths; if the gantry is not locked and unloaded when parked for a typhoon, cross-wind can slide or topple it onto completed spans. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：架橋機推進時重心沿縱向移動，風力又作用在高聳的主桁與節塊上，所以墩帽承壓、墩柱彎矩、基礎與支承臨時鎖定都要以施工荷載逐一檢核，而不是只套用營運荷載組合。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: As the gantry launches, its centre of gravity moves along the bridge and wind acts on the tall girders and hanging segments, so pier-cap bearing, column bending, foundations and temporary bearing locks must each be checked for construction loads rather than service combinations alone.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「架橋機的荷重只是暫時的，橋墩照營運荷載設計就足夠。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Gantry loads are only temporary, so piers designed for service loads are always sufficient.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b039-v13-08-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"支腿落在墩帽邊緣或未經設計的位置，可能壓碎墩帽混凝土或使支承墊石開裂；若颱風停機時未鎖定架橋機並降低懸吊荷重，側風可能使架橋機橫移甚至倒塌，砸毀已完成的跨。","textEn":"Legs landing near the edge of a pier cap or at an undesigned position can crush the cap concrete or crack bearing plinths; if the gantry is not locked and unloaded when parked for a typhoon, cross-wind can slide or topple it onto completed spans.","sourceIds":["v13s-asbi-segmental-construction","v13s-pci-bang-na-2000","v13s-pci-muller-bridge-engineer-2006","v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-wiki-seven-mile-bridge"]},{"id":"b039-v13-08-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v13s-asbi-segmental-construction","v13s-pci-bang-na-2000","v13s-pci-muller-bridge-engineer-2006","v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-wiki-seven-mile-bridge"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「架橋機與橋墩的施工期荷載」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Gantry construction loads on the piers\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["補一層塗料或放寬允收值，就能解決大多數劣化問題。","乾接縫只是少塗一層環氧，結構行為與環氧接縫完全相同。","支腿落在墩帽邊緣或未經設計的位置，可能壓碎墩帽混凝土或使支承墊石開裂；若颱風停機時未鎖定架橋機並降低懸吊荷重，側風可能使架橋機橫移甚至倒塌，砸毀已完成的跨。"],"optionsEn":["Adding a coat of paint or widening the acceptance limits solves most deterioration problems.","A dry joint is just an epoxy joint without the epoxy and behaves identically.","Legs landing near the edge of a pier cap or at an undesigned position can crush the cap concrete or crack bearing plinths."],"answer":2,"explanation":"支腿落在墩帽邊緣或未經設計的位置，可能壓碎墩帽混凝土或使支承墊石開裂；若颱風停機時未鎖定架橋機並降低懸吊荷重，側風可能使架橋機橫移甚至倒塌，砸毀已完成的跨。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Legs landing near the edge of a pier cap or at an undesigned position can crush the cap concrete or crack bearing plinths; if the gantry is not locked and unloaded when parked for a typhoon, cross-wind can slide or topple it onto completed spans. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":2,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":8}],"order":1},{"id":"b039-v13-s2","title":"材料、構件與接合細部","titleEn":"Materials, members and connection details","description":"本階段聚焦「匹配澆注接縫：乾接縫與環氧接縫」與「體外鋼腱的轉向塊與錨碇」：先建立傳力機制與定量模型，再設計試驗驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"Match-cast joints: dry and epoxy\" and \"Deviators and anchorages for external tendons\": build the load path and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"b039-v13-09","title":"匹配澆注接縫：乾接縫與環氧接縫：機制與傳力路徑","titleEn":"Match-cast joints: dry and epoxy: mechanism and load path","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-asbi-segmental-construction","v13s-pci-bang-na-2000","v13s-pci-muller-bridge-engineer-2006","v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-wiki-seven-mile-bridge"],"prerequisiteIds":["b039-v13-08"],"objective":"說明「剪力鍵與乾接縫」如何影響橋梁逐跨預鑄節塊架設的受力、變形或耐久表現，並畫出荷載的來源、傳遞路徑與支承邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Shear keys and dry joints” governs force, deformation or durability in “Span-by-span precast bridge erection”, and map where loads come from, how they travel and where they are supported.","instruction":"逐跨工法的節塊在預製場以匹配澆注製作，相鄰節塊端面完全吻合，並設多重剪力鍵。佛州 Long Key 橋與曼谷 Bang Na 高架道路採用乾接縫，完全依靠體外預力壓緊接縫與剪力鍵傳遞剪力；許多新近規範則要求環氧接縫，用以密封接縫、填補微小不平並在架設時潤滑定位。乾接縫施工快、不受天候影響，但接縫沒有任何抗拉能力，也不能防水，因此需要較高的殘餘壓應力與更好的箱內防水。 師傅任務：以自由體圖或傳力路徑圖畫出荷載如何經過「剪力鍵與乾接縫」傳到支承或基礎，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Span-by-span segments are match-cast in the yard, so the faces of adjacent segments fit exactly and carry multiple shear keys. Florida's Long Key Bridge and Bangkok's Bang Na Expressway used dry joints, relying entirely on external prestress to clamp the joints so shear keys transfer shear; many recent specifications require epoxy joints instead, to seal the joint, fill small irregularities and lubricate alignment during erection. Dry joints are fast and weather-independent, but they have no tensile capacity and no water-tightness, so they need higher residual compression and better waterproofing of the box. Mentor task: draw a free-body or load-path diagram showing how loads pass through “Shear keys and dry joints” to the supports or foundation, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：支點剪力 V = 180×42/2 + 50×42/2 + 1,500 = 6,330 kN。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Support shear V = 180×42/2 + 50×42/2 + 1,500 = 6,330 kN.","failure":"常見誤解：「乾接縫只是少塗一層環氧，結構行為與環氧接縫完全相同。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在傳力圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"A dry joint is just an epoxy joint without the epoxy and behaves identically.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your load-path diagram where it breaks down.","check":"傳力圖標明「剪力鍵與乾接縫」的荷載來源、傳遞路徑與支承；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The load-path diagram shows load sources, path and supports for “Shear keys and dry joints”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b039-v13-09-k1","title":"匹配澆注接縫：乾接縫與環氧接縫","titleEn":"Match-cast joints: dry and epoxy","text":"逐跨工法的節塊在預製場以匹配澆注製作，相鄰節塊端面完全吻合，並設多重剪力鍵。佛州 Long Key 橋與曼谷 Bang Na 高架道路採用乾接縫，完全依靠體外預力壓緊接縫與剪力鍵傳遞剪力；許多新近規範則要求環氧接縫，用以密封接縫、填補微小不平並在架設時潤滑定位。","textEn":"Span-by-span segments are match-cast in the yard, so the faces of adjacent segments fit exactly and carry multiple shear keys. Florida's Long Key Bridge and Bangkok's Bang Na Expressway used dry joints, relying entirely on external prestress to clamp the joints so shear keys transfer shear; many recent specifications require epoxy joints instead, to seal the joint, fill small irregularities and lubricate alignment during erection.","sourceIds":["v13s-asbi-segmental-construction","v13s-pci-bang-na-2000","v13s-pci-muller-bridge-engineer-2006","v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-wiki-seven-mile-bridge"]},{"id":"b039-v13-09-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：乾接縫只是少塗一層環氧，結構行為與環氧接縫完全相同。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: A dry joint is just an epoxy joint without the epoxy and behaves identically. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v13s-asbi-segmental-construction","v13s-pci-bang-na-2000","v13s-pci-muller-bridge-engineer-2006","v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-wiki-seven-mile-bridge"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「匹配澆注接縫：乾接縫與環氧接縫」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Match-cast joints: dry and epoxy\" is correct?","options":["逐跨工法的節塊在預製場以匹配澆注製作，相鄰節塊端面完全吻合，並設多重剪力鍵。","乾接縫只是少塗一層環氧，結構行為與環氧接縫完全相同。","體外鋼腱不埋在混凝土裡，所以轉向塊只需要很少的鋼筋。"],"optionsEn":["Span-by-span segments are match-cast in the yard, so the faces of adjacent segments fit exactly and carry multiple shear keys.","A dry joint is just an epoxy joint without the epoxy and behaves identically.","Because external tendons are not embedded, deviators need very little reinforcement."],"answer":0,"explanation":"逐跨工法的節塊在預製場以匹配澆注製作，相鄰節塊端面完全吻合，並設多重剪力鍵。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Span-by-span segments are match-cast in the yard, so the faces of adjacent segments fit exactly and carry multiple shear keys. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":3,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":9},{"id":"b039-v13-10","title":"匹配澆注接縫：乾接縫與環氧接縫：定量估算","titleEn":"Match-cast joints: dry and epoxy: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-asbi-segmental-construction","v13s-pci-bang-na-2000","v13s-pci-muller-bridge-engineer-2006","v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-wiki-seven-mile-bridge"],"prerequisiteIds":["b039-v13-09"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「剪力鍵與乾接縫」的關鍵量，並判斷跨度、荷載、溫度或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Shear keys and dry joints” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when span, load, temperature or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：支點剪力 V = 180×42/2 + 50×42/2 + 1,500 = 6,330 kN。若腹板範圍分擔 30% 預力，摩擦係數 μ = 0.6，接縫摩擦抗剪 V_f = 0.6×0.3×43,200 ≈ 7,776 kN，比值 7,776/6,330 ≈ 1.23（未計剪力鍵貢獻）。數值為教學假設。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Support shear V = 180×42/2 + 50×42/2 + 1,500 = 6,330 kN. If the webs carry 30% of the prestress and μ = 0.6, joint friction resistance is V_f = 0.6×0.3×43,200 ≈ 7,776 kN, a ratio of 7,776/6,330 ≈ 1.23 before counting shear keys. Values are teaching assumptions. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：預製場每一節塊拆模後檢查剪力鍵完整性與端面清潔，架設前做乾接合試拼；環氧接縫則記錄批號、溫度與適用時間，並檢查擠出是否沿全周連續。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: In the yard, inspect shear-key integrity and face cleanliness after each segment is stripped, and dry-fit before erection; for epoxy joints, record lot, temperature and pot life and check that squeeze-out is continuous round the perimeter.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b039-v13-10-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"支點剪力 V = 180×42/2 + 50×42/2 + 1,500 = 6,330 kN。若腹板範圍分擔 30% 預力，摩擦係數 μ = 0.6，接縫摩擦抗剪 V_f = 0.6×0.3×43,200 ≈ 7,776 kN，比值 7,776/6,330 ≈ 1.23（未計剪力鍵貢獻）。數值為教學假設。","textEn":"Support shear V = 180×42/2 + 50×42/2 + 1,500 = 6,330 kN. If the webs carry 30% of the prestress and μ = 0.6, joint friction resistance is V_f = 0.6×0.3×43,200 ≈ 7,776 kN, a ratio of 7,776/6,330 ≈ 1.23 before counting shear keys. Values are teaching assumptions.","sourceIds":["v13s-asbi-segmental-construction","v13s-pci-bang-na-2000","v13s-pci-muller-bridge-engineer-2006","v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-wiki-seven-mile-bridge"]},{"id":"b039-v13-10-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v13s-asbi-segmental-construction","v13s-pci-bang-na-2000","v13s-pci-muller-bridge-engineer-2006","v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-wiki-seven-mile-bridge"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「匹配澆注接縫：乾接縫與環氧接縫」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Match-cast joints: dry and epoxy\", which statement holds?","options":["張拉完成後只要拆除吊桿，荷重自然會平均傳到四個支承。","支點剪力 V = 180×42/2 + 50×42/2 + 1,500 = 6,330 kN。","體外鋼腱張拉完成後力量不會改變，所以不需要再量測。"],"optionsEn":["After stressing, removing the hangers automatically shares the load equally among the four bearings.","Support shear V = 180×42/2 + 50×42/2 + 1,500 = 6,330 kN.","Once stressed, an external tendon's force never changes, so it need not be measured again."],"answer":1,"explanation":"支點剪力 V = 180×42/2 + 50×42/2 + 1,500 = 6,330 kN。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Support shear V = 180×42/2 + 50×42/2 + 1,500 = 6,330 kN. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":3,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":10},{"id":"b039-v13-11","title":"匹配澆注接縫：乾接縫與環氧接縫：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Match-cast joints: dry and epoxy: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-asbi-segmental-construction","v13s-pci-bang-na-2000","v13s-pci-muller-bridge-engineer-2006","v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-wiki-seven-mile-bridge"],"prerequisiteIds":["b039-v13-10"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「剪力鍵與乾接縫」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Shear keys and dry joints” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"預製場每一節塊拆模後檢查剪力鍵完整性與端面清潔，架設前做乾接合試拼；環氧接縫則記錄批號、溫度與適用時間，並檢查擠出是否沿全周連續。張拉後以塞尺抽查接縫是否完全閉合，任何開口都要記錄位置與深度。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"In the yard, inspect shear-key integrity and face cleanliness after each segment is stripped, and dry-fit before erection; for epoxy joints, record lot, temperature and pot life and check that squeeze-out is continuous round the perimeter. After stressing, spot-check joint closure with feeler gauges and record the location and depth of any opening. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：接縫型式（乾或環氧）、最低殘餘壓應力、剪力鍵修補程序與箱內排水設計應在招標文件中一次訂定，施工中不得以趕工為由由環氧改為乾接縫。","observationEn":"Site practice: Specify joint type (dry or epoxy), minimum residual compression, shear-key repair procedure and box drainage in the tender documents, and forbid switching from epoxy to dry joints during construction to save time.","failure":"注意干擾：剪力鍵在運輸或吊裝時崩角而未修補，接縫局部承壓集中，張拉時可能進一步崩裂；乾接縫若殘餘壓應力不足，重車通過時接縫反覆微開，箱內積水沿底板流向錨碇區，成為腐蝕源頭。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、日照與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: Shear keys chipped in transport or lifting and left unrepaired concentrate bearing and can spall further during stressing; dry joints with too little residual compression breathe open under heavy trucks, letting water collect inside the box and run along the bottom slab to the anchorages, starting corrosion. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, sunshine and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b039-v13-11-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"預製場每一節塊拆模後檢查剪力鍵完整性與端面清潔，架設前做乾接合試拼；環氧接縫則記錄批號、溫度與適用時間，並檢查擠出是否沿全周連續。張拉後以塞尺抽查接縫是否完全閉合，任何開口都要記錄位置與深度。","textEn":"In the yard, inspect shear-key integrity and face cleanliness after each segment is stripped, and dry-fit before erection; for epoxy joints, record lot, temperature and pot life and check that squeeze-out is continuous round the perimeter. After stressing, spot-check joint closure with feeler gauges and record the location and depth of any opening.","sourceIds":["v13s-asbi-segmental-construction","v13s-pci-bang-na-2000","v13s-pci-muller-bridge-engineer-2006","v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-wiki-seven-mile-bridge"]},{"id":"b039-v13-11-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"接縫型式（乾或環氧）、最低殘餘壓應力、剪力鍵修補程序與箱內排水設計應在招標文件中一次訂定，施工中不得以趕工為由由環氧改為乾接縫。","textEn":"Specify joint type (dry or epoxy), minimum residual compression, shear-key repair procedure and box drainage in the tender documents, and forbid switching from epoxy to dry joints during construction to save time.","sourceIds":["v13s-asbi-segmental-construction","v13s-pci-bang-na-2000","v13s-pci-muller-bridge-engineer-2006","v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-wiki-seven-mile-bridge"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「匹配澆注接縫：乾接縫與環氧接縫」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Match-cast joints: dry and epoxy\"?","options":["只看一次讀值或外觀即可判定合格，不需要基準點、參考試體或重複量測。","接縫出現滲水只是防水問題，與結構無關。","預製場每一節塊拆模後檢查剪力鍵完整性與端面清潔，架設前做乾接合試拼；環氧接縫則記錄批號、溫度與適用時間，並檢查擠出是否沿全周連續。"],"optionsEn":["A single reading or a visual impression is enough to accept the work; no datum, reference specimen or repeat measurement is needed.","Water seeping at a segment joint is only a waterproofing issue with no structural meaning.","In the yard, inspect shear-key integrity and face cleanliness after each segment is stripped, and dry-fit before erection."],"answer":2,"explanation":"預製場每一節塊拆模後檢查剪力鍵完整性與端面清潔，架設前做乾接合試拼；環氧接縫則記錄批號、溫度與適用時間，並檢查擠出是否沿全周連續。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"In the yard, inspect shear-key integrity and face cleanliness after each segment is stripped, and dry-fit before erection; for epoxy joints, record lot, temperature and pot life and check that squeeze-out is continuous round the perimeter. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":3,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":11},{"id":"b039-v13-12","title":"匹配澆注接縫：乾接縫與環氧接縫：失效診斷","titleEn":"Match-cast joints: dry and epoxy: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-asbi-segmental-construction","v13s-pci-bang-na-2000","v13s-pci-muller-bridge-engineer-2006","v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-wiki-seven-mile-bridge"],"prerequisiteIds":["b039-v13-11"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「剪力鍵與乾接縫」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Shear keys and dry joints” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"剪力鍵在運輸或吊裝時崩角而未修補，接縫局部承壓集中，張拉時可能進一步崩裂；乾接縫若殘餘壓應力不足，重車通過時接縫反覆微開，箱內積水沿底板流向錨碇區，成為腐蝕源頭。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"Shear keys chipped in transport or lifting and left unrepaired concentrate bearing and can spall further during stressing; dry joints with too little residual compression breathe open under heavy trucks, letting water collect inside the box and run along the bottom slab to the anchorages, starting corrosion. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：乾接縫施工快、不受天候影響，但接縫沒有任何抗拉能力，也不能防水，因此需要較高的殘餘壓應力與更好的箱內防水。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Dry joints are fast and weather-independent, but they have no tensile capacity and no water-tightness, so they need higher residual compression and better waterproofing of the box.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「乾接縫只是少塗一層環氧，結構行為與環氧接縫完全相同。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"A dry joint is just an epoxy joint without the epoxy and behaves identically.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b039-v13-12-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"剪力鍵在運輸或吊裝時崩角而未修補，接縫局部承壓集中，張拉時可能進一步崩裂；乾接縫若殘餘壓應力不足，重車通過時接縫反覆微開，箱內積水沿底板流向錨碇區，成為腐蝕源頭。","textEn":"Shear keys chipped in transport or lifting and left unrepaired concentrate bearing and can spall further during stressing; dry joints with too little residual compression breathe open under heavy trucks, letting water collect inside the box and run along the bottom slab to the anchorages, starting corrosion.","sourceIds":["v13s-asbi-segmental-construction","v13s-pci-bang-na-2000","v13s-pci-muller-bridge-engineer-2006","v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-wiki-seven-mile-bridge"]},{"id":"b039-v13-12-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v13s-asbi-segmental-construction","v13s-pci-bang-na-2000","v13s-pci-muller-bridge-engineer-2006","v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-wiki-seven-mile-bridge"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「匹配澆注接縫：乾接縫與環氧接縫」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Match-cast joints: dry and epoxy\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["剪力鍵在運輸或吊裝時崩角而未修補，接縫局部承壓集中，張拉時可能進一步崩裂。","裂縫或異常只出現一次就可以忽略，不需要記錄或追蹤。","體外鋼腱不埋在混凝土裡，所以轉向塊只需要很少的鋼筋。"],"optionsEn":["Shear keys chipped in transport or lifting and left unrepaired concentrate bearing and can spall further during stressing.","A crack or anomaly that appears only once can be ignored without logging or follow-up.","Because external tendons are not embedded, deviators need very little reinforcement."],"answer":0,"explanation":"剪力鍵在運輸或吊裝時崩角而未修補，接縫局部承壓集中，張拉時可能進一步崩裂；乾接縫若殘餘壓應力不足，重車通過時接縫反覆微開，箱內積水沿底板流向錨碇區，成為腐蝕源頭。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Shear keys chipped in transport or lifting and left unrepaired concentrate bearing and can spall further during stressing; dry joints with too little residual compression breathe open under heavy trucks, letting water collect inside the box and run along the bottom slab to the anchorages, starting corrosion. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":3,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":12},{"id":"b039-v13-13","title":"體外鋼腱的轉向塊與錨碇：機制與傳力路徑","titleEn":"Deviators and anchorages for external tendons: mechanism and load path","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-asbi-segmental-construction","v13s-pci-bang-na-2000","v13s-pci-muller-bridge-engineer-2006","v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-wiki-seven-mile-bridge"],"prerequisiteIds":["b039-v13-12"],"objective":"說明「轉向塊與錨碇橫隔」如何影響橋梁逐跨預鑄節塊架設的受力、變形或耐久表現，並畫出荷載的來源、傳遞路徑與支承邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Deviators and anchorage diaphragms” governs force, deformation or durability in “Span-by-span precast bridge erection”, and map where loads come from, how they travel and where they are supported.","instruction":"體外鋼腱位於箱梁內部但不埋在混凝土中，只在端部錨碇橫隔與跨內轉向塊與結構接觸。鋼腱在轉向塊轉折時，會對轉向塊施加向上與向內的集中力，轉向塊必須以鋼筋把這股力吊掛回腹板與頂板；錨碇橫隔則要把整束鋼腱的集中力擴散到整個箱梁斷面。轉向處預埋彎曲鋼管，彎曲半徑與出口喇叭口要能避免鋼絞線在邊緣受到尖角磨損。 師傅任務：以自由體圖或傳力路徑圖畫出荷載如何經過「轉向塊與錨碇橫隔」傳到支承或基礎，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"External tendons run inside the box but are not embedded in concrete; they touch the structure only at end anchorage diaphragms and intermediate deviators. Where a tendon changes direction at a deviator it pushes upward and inward with a concentrated force that the deviator reinforcement must hang back into the webs and top slab, while the anchorage diaphragm must spread the full tendon force into the whole box section. Deviators contain preformed curved steel pipes whose radius and flared exits prevent strands from being nicked on sharp edges. Mentor task: draw a free-body or load-path diagram showing how loads pass through “Deviators and anchorage diaphragms” to the supports or foundation, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：轉向力 F = 2P·sin(θ/2)。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Deviation force F = 2P·sin(θ/2).","failure":"常見誤解：「體外鋼腱不埋在混凝土裡，所以轉向塊只需要很少的鋼筋。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在傳力圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Because external tendons are not embedded, deviators need very little reinforcement.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your load-path diagram where it breaks down.","check":"傳力圖標明「轉向塊與錨碇橫隔」的荷載來源、傳遞路徑與支承；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The load-path diagram shows load sources, path and supports for “Deviators and anchorage diaphragms”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b039-v13-13-k1","title":"體外鋼腱的轉向塊與錨碇","titleEn":"Deviators and anchorages for external tendons","text":"體外鋼腱位於箱梁內部但不埋在混凝土中，只在端部錨碇橫隔與跨內轉向塊與結構接觸。鋼腱在轉向塊轉折時，會對轉向塊施加向上與向內的集中力，轉向塊必須以鋼筋把這股力吊掛回腹板與頂板；錨碇橫隔則要把整束鋼腱的集中力擴散到整個箱梁斷面。","textEn":"External tendons run inside the box but are not embedded in concrete; they touch the structure only at end anchorage diaphragms and intermediate deviators. Where a tendon changes direction at a deviator it pushes upward and inward with a concentrated force that the deviator reinforcement must hang back into the webs and top slab, while the anchorage diaphragm must spread the full tendon force into the whole box section.","sourceIds":["v13s-asbi-segmental-construction","v13s-pci-bang-na-2000","v13s-pci-muller-bridge-engineer-2006","v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-wiki-seven-mile-bridge"]},{"id":"b039-v13-13-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：體外鋼腱不埋在混凝土裡，所以轉向塊只需要很少的鋼筋。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Because external tendons are not embedded, deviators need very little reinforcement. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v13s-asbi-segmental-construction","v13s-pci-bang-na-2000","v13s-pci-muller-bridge-engineer-2006","v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-wiki-seven-mile-bridge"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「體外鋼腱的轉向塊與錨碇」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Deviators and anchorages for external tendons\" is correct?","options":["體外鋼腱不埋在混凝土裡，所以轉向塊只需要很少的鋼筋。","體外鋼腱位於箱梁內部但不埋在混凝土中，只在端部錨碇橫隔與跨內轉向塊與結構接觸。","架橋機本身很重，所以推進時不可能傾覆。"],"optionsEn":["Because external tendons are not embedded, deviators need very little reinforcement.","External tendons run inside the box but are not embedded in concrete; they touch the structure only at end anchorage diaphragms and intermediate deviators.","A gantry is so heavy that it cannot overturn while launching."],"answer":1,"explanation":"體外鋼腱位於箱梁內部但不埋在混凝土中，只在端部錨碇橫隔與跨內轉向塊與結構接觸。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"External tendons run inside the box but are not embedded in concrete; they touch the structure only at end anchorage diaphragms and intermediate deviators. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":4,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":13},{"id":"b039-v13-14","title":"體外鋼腱的轉向塊與錨碇：定量估算","titleEn":"Deviators and anchorages for external tendons: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-asbi-segmental-construction","v13s-pci-bang-na-2000","v13s-pci-muller-bridge-engineer-2006","v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-wiki-seven-mile-bridge"],"prerequisiteIds":["b039-v13-13"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「轉向塊與錨碇橫隔」的關鍵量，並判斷跨度、荷載、溫度或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Deviators and anchorage diaphragms” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when span, load, temperature or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：轉向力 F = 2P·sin(θ/2)。每束張拉時 P = 3,711 kN、轉角 θ = 0.10 rad：F = 2×3,711×sin(0.05) ≈ 371 kN；一側腹板 6 束合計約 2,226 kN，轉向塊吊筋須以此力加上設計放大係數配置。數值為教學假設。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Deviation force F = 2P·sin(θ/2). With P = 3,711 kN per tendon at jacking and θ = 0.10 rad, F = 2×3,711×sin(0.05) ≈ 371 kN; six tendons on one web give about 2,226 kN, which the deviator hanger reinforcement must carry with the design load factor. Values are teaching assumptions. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：預製轉向塊節塊時，以三維量測確認預埋彎管的進出口座標與角度，與鋼腱線形圖比對；張拉後檢查轉向塊周邊混凝土是否出現放射狀或沿腹板的裂縫，並記錄寬度作為基準。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: When casting deviator segments, survey the entry and exit coordinates and angles of the curved pipes in 3D and compare them with the tendon profile drawings; after stressing, inspect concrete around deviators for radial cracks or cracks along the webs and record widths as a baseline.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b039-v13-14-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"轉向力 F = 2P·sin(θ/2)。每束張拉時 P = 3,711 kN、轉角 θ = 0.10 rad：F = 2×3,711×sin(0.05) ≈ 371 kN；一側腹板 6 束合計約 2,226 kN，轉向塊吊筋須以此力加上設計放大係數配置。數值為教學假設。","textEn":"Deviation force F = 2P·sin(θ/2). With P = 3,711 kN per tendon at jacking and θ = 0.10 rad, F = 2×3,711×sin(0.05) ≈ 371 kN; six tendons on one web give about 2,226 kN, which the deviator hanger reinforcement must carry with the design load factor. Values are teaching assumptions.","sourceIds":["v13s-asbi-segmental-construction","v13s-pci-bang-na-2000","v13s-pci-muller-bridge-engineer-2006","v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-wiki-seven-mile-bridge"]},{"id":"b039-v13-14-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v13s-asbi-segmental-construction","v13s-pci-bang-na-2000","v13s-pci-muller-bridge-engineer-2006","v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-wiki-seven-mile-bridge"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「體外鋼腱的轉向塊與錨碇」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Deviators and anchorages for external tendons\", which statement holds?","options":["預製場的模板精度夠高，就不需要逐塊量測幾何。","體外鋼腱有 HDPE 套管保護，所以不會腐蝕。","轉向力 F = 2P·sin(θ/2)。"],"optionsEn":["If the yard forms are accurate enough, segment geometry need not be surveyed one by one.","External tendons in HDPE sheaths cannot corrode.","Deviation force F = 2P·sin(θ/2)."],"answer":2,"explanation":"轉向力 F = 2P·sin(θ/2)。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Deviation force F = 2P·sin(θ/2). Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":4,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":14},{"id":"b039-v13-15","title":"體外鋼腱的轉向塊與錨碇：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Deviators and anchorages for external tendons: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-asbi-segmental-construction","v13s-pci-bang-na-2000","v13s-pci-muller-bridge-engineer-2006","v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-wiki-seven-mile-bridge"],"prerequisiteIds":["b039-v13-14"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「轉向塊與錨碇橫隔」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Deviators and anchorage diaphragms” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"預製轉向塊節塊時，以三維量測確認預埋彎管的進出口座標與角度，與鋼腱線形圖比對；張拉後檢查轉向塊周邊混凝土是否出現放射狀或沿腹板的裂縫，並記錄寬度作為基準。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"When casting deviator segments, survey the entry and exit coordinates and angles of the curved pipes in 3D and compare them with the tendon profile drawings; after stressing, inspect concrete around deviators for radial cracks or cracks along the webs and record widths as a baseline. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：轉向塊與錨碇節塊屬於關鍵節塊，預製時應有專屬檢查表（彎管座標、鋼筋、混凝土強度），並保留量測紀錄隨節塊編號歸檔；彎管出口須有圓滑過渡並經監造逐一確認。","observationEn":"Site practice: Deviator and anchorage segments are critical segments that need dedicated checklists in the yard (pipe coordinates, reinforcement, concrete strength), with survey records filed under each segment number; pipe exits must have smooth transitions confirmed one by one by the supervising engineer.","failure":"注意干擾：彎管角度或位置錯誤使鋼腱在出口處形成尖角折線，鋼絞線外層 HDPE 套管被磨破，長期振動下套管破損處成為腐蝕點；轉向塊吊筋不足則在張拉時把轉向塊從腹板拉出裂縫。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、日照與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: A pipe set at the wrong angle or position kinks the tendon at the exit, wearing through the HDPE sheath, and under long-term vibration the damaged sheath becomes a corrosion point; insufficient hanger reinforcement lets the stressing force crack the deviator away from the web. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, sunshine and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b039-v13-15-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"預製轉向塊節塊時，以三維量測確認預埋彎管的進出口座標與角度，與鋼腱線形圖比對；張拉後檢查轉向塊周邊混凝土是否出現放射狀或沿腹板的裂縫，並記錄寬度作為基準。","textEn":"When casting deviator segments, survey the entry and exit coordinates and angles of the curved pipes in 3D and compare them with the tendon profile drawings; after stressing, inspect concrete around deviators for radial cracks or cracks along the webs and record widths as a baseline.","sourceIds":["v13s-asbi-segmental-construction","v13s-pci-bang-na-2000","v13s-pci-muller-bridge-engineer-2006","v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-wiki-seven-mile-bridge"]},{"id":"b039-v13-15-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"轉向塊與錨碇節塊屬於關鍵節塊，預製時應有專屬檢查表（彎管座標、鋼筋、混凝土強度），並保留量測紀錄隨節塊編號歸檔；彎管出口須有圓滑過渡並經監造逐一確認。","textEn":"Deviator and anchorage segments are critical segments that need dedicated checklists in the yard (pipe coordinates, reinforcement, concrete strength), with survey records filed under each segment number; pipe exits must have smooth transitions confirmed one by one by the supervising engineer.","sourceIds":["v13s-asbi-segmental-construction","v13s-pci-bang-na-2000","v13s-pci-muller-bridge-engineer-2006","v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-wiki-seven-mile-bridge"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「體外鋼腱的轉向塊與錨碇」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Deviators and anchorages for external tendons\"?","options":["預製轉向塊節塊時，以三維量測確認預埋彎管的進出口座標與角度，與鋼腱線形圖比對；張拉後檢查轉向塊周邊混凝土是否出現放射狀或沿腹板的裂縫，並記錄寬度作為基準。","不確定度太難估計，報告中只寫最佳值即可。","逐跨架設的節塊接縫在營運時可以像鋼筋混凝土一樣容許開裂。"],"optionsEn":["When casting deviator segments, survey the entry and exit coordinates and angles of the curved pipes in 3D and compare them with the tendon profile drawings.","Uncertainty is too hard to estimate, so the report may state only the best value.","Joints in span-by-span segmental spans may crack in service just like reinforced concrete."],"answer":0,"explanation":"預製轉向塊節塊時，以三維量測確認預埋彎管的進出口座標與角度，與鋼腱線形圖比對；張拉後檢查轉向塊周邊混凝土是否出現放射狀或沿腹板的裂縫，並記錄寬度作為基準。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"When casting deviator segments, survey the entry and exit coordinates and angles of the curved pipes in 3D and compare them with the tendon profile drawings; after stressing, inspect concrete around deviators for radial cracks or cracks along the webs and record widths as a baseline. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":4,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":15},{"id":"b039-v13-16","title":"體外鋼腱的轉向塊與錨碇：失效診斷","titleEn":"Deviators and anchorages for external tendons: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-asbi-segmental-construction","v13s-pci-bang-na-2000","v13s-pci-muller-bridge-engineer-2006","v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-wiki-seven-mile-bridge"],"prerequisiteIds":["b039-v13-15"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「轉向塊與錨碇橫隔」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Deviators and anchorage diaphragms” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"彎管角度或位置錯誤使鋼腱在出口處形成尖角折線，鋼絞線外層 HDPE 套管被磨破，長期振動下套管破損處成為腐蝕點；轉向塊吊筋不足則在張拉時把轉向塊從腹板拉出裂縫。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"A pipe set at the wrong angle or position kinks the tendon at the exit, wearing through the HDPE sheath, and under long-term vibration the damaged sheath becomes a corrosion point; insufficient hanger reinforcement lets the stressing force crack the deviator away from the web. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：轉向處預埋彎曲鋼管，彎曲半徑與出口喇叭口要能避免鋼絞線在邊緣受到尖角磨損。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Deviators contain preformed curved steel pipes whose radius and flared exits prevent strands from being nicked on sharp edges.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「體外鋼腱不埋在混凝土裡，所以轉向塊只需要很少的鋼筋。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Because external tendons are not embedded, deviators need very little reinforcement.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b039-v13-16-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"彎管角度或位置錯誤使鋼腱在出口處形成尖角折線，鋼絞線外層 HDPE 套管被磨破，長期振動下套管破損處成為腐蝕點；轉向塊吊筋不足則在張拉時把轉向塊從腹板拉出裂縫。","textEn":"A pipe set at the wrong angle or position kinks the tendon at the exit, wearing through the HDPE sheath, and under long-term vibration the damaged sheath becomes a corrosion point; insufficient hanger reinforcement lets the stressing force crack the deviator away from the web.","sourceIds":["v13s-asbi-segmental-construction","v13s-pci-bang-na-2000","v13s-pci-muller-bridge-engineer-2006","v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-wiki-seven-mile-bridge"]},{"id":"b039-v13-16-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v13s-asbi-segmental-construction","v13s-pci-bang-na-2000","v13s-pci-muller-bridge-engineer-2006","v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-wiki-seven-mile-bridge"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「體外鋼腱的轉向塊與錨碇」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Deviators and anchorages for external tendons\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["先更換最貴的構件；只要症狀消失，就代表已找到根因。","彎管角度或位置錯誤使鋼腱在出口處形成尖角折線，鋼絞線外層 HDPE 套管被磨破，長期振動下套管破損處成為腐蝕點；轉向塊吊筋不足則在張拉時把轉向塊從腹板拉出裂縫。","架橋機本身很重，所以推進時不可能傾覆。"],"optionsEn":["Replace the most expensive component first; if the symptom disappears, the root cause has been found.","A pipe set at the wrong angle or position kinks the tendon at the exit, wearing through the HDPE sheath, and under long-term vibration the damaged sheath becomes a corrosion point.","A gantry is so heavy that it cannot overturn while launching."],"answer":1,"explanation":"彎管角度或位置錯誤使鋼腱在出口處形成尖角折線，鋼絞線外層 HDPE 套管被磨破，長期振動下套管破損處成為腐蝕點；轉向塊吊筋不足則在張拉時把轉向塊從腹板拉出裂縫。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"A pipe set at the wrong angle or position kinks the tendon at the exit, wearing through the HDPE sheath, and under long-term vibration the damaged sheath becomes a corrosion point; insufficient hanger reinforcement lets the stressing force crack the deviator away from the web. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":4,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":16}],"order":2},{"id":"b039-v13-s3","title":"施工方法與施工階段控制","titleEn":"Construction methods and stage control","description":"本階段聚焦「架橋機推進、懸臂與防傾覆」與「整跨組裝、張拉與荷重轉換」：先建立傳力機制與定量模型，再設計試驗驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"Gantry launching, cantilevering and overturning\" and \"Span assembly, stressing and load transfer\": build the load path and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"b039-v13-17","title":"架橋機推進、懸臂與防傾覆：機制與傳力路徑","titleEn":"Gantry launching, cantilevering and overturning: mechanism and load path","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-asbi-segmental-construction","v13s-pci-bang-na-2000","v13s-pci-muller-bridge-engineer-2006","v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-wiki-seven-mile-bridge"],"prerequisiteIds":["b039-v13-16"],"objective":"說明「架橋機推進穩定」如何影響橋梁逐跨預鑄節塊架設的受力、變形或耐久表現，並畫出荷載的來源、傳遞路徑與支承邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Gantry launching stability” governs force, deformation or durability in “Span-by-span precast bridge erection”, and map where loads come from, how they travel and where they are supported.","instruction":"架橋機完成一跨後，要把主桁推向下一座橋墩：推進過程中主桁前端有一段很長的懸臂，重心必須始終位於後支點之內，否則整機前傾。推進時通常先把前支腿收起，主桁以後支點與中支點滑移，到達下一墩後放下前支腿，再移動後支腿。推進作業的風速限制、縱坡與彎道造成的側向分力、以及支腿與墩頂的錨定，都是決定能否安全推進的條件。 師傅任務：以自由體圖或傳力路徑圖畫出荷載如何經過「架橋機推進穩定」傳到支承或基礎，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"After completing a span, the gantry girder must be pushed to the next pier; during launching its front end becomes a long cantilever, and the centre of gravity must always stay inside the rear support or the machine tips forward. The front leg is usually lifted, the girder slides on rear and middle supports, the front leg is lowered on reaching the next pier, and then the rear leg is moved. Wind-speed limits, longitudinal gradient, lateral components on curves and the anchorage of legs to the pier top all decide whether launching is safe. Mentor task: draw a free-body or load-path diagram showing how loads pass through “Gantry launching stability” to the supports or foundation, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：主桁均布重 q = 60 kN/m，後段 50 m、前懸臂 42 m：傾覆彎矩 M_o = 60×42²/2 = 52,920 kN·m，抵抗彎矩 M_r = 60×50²/2 = 75,000 kN·m，安全係數 75,000/52,920 ≈ 1.42。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: With a girder weight q = 60 kN/m, 50 m behind the pivot and a 42 m front cantilever: overturning moment M_o = 60×42²/2 = 52,920 kN·m, restoring moment M_r = 60×50²/2 = 75,000 kN·m, factor 75,000/52,920 ≈ 1.42.","failure":"常見誤解：「架橋機本身很重，所以推進時不可能傾覆。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在傳力圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"A gantry is so heavy that it cannot overturn while launching.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your load-path diagram where it breaks down.","check":"傳力圖標明「架橋機推進穩定」的荷載來源、傳遞路徑與支承；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The load-path diagram shows load sources, path and supports for “Gantry launching stability”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b039-v13-17-k1","title":"架橋機推進、懸臂與防傾覆","titleEn":"Gantry launching, cantilevering and overturning","text":"架橋機完成一跨後，要把主桁推向下一座橋墩：推進過程中主桁前端有一段很長的懸臂，重心必須始終位於後支點之內，否則整機前傾。推進時通常先把前支腿收起，主桁以後支點與中支點滑移，到達下一墩後放下前支腿，再移動後支腿。","textEn":"After completing a span, the gantry girder must be pushed to the next pier; during launching its front end becomes a long cantilever, and the centre of gravity must always stay inside the rear support or the machine tips forward. The front leg is usually lifted, the girder slides on rear and middle supports, the front leg is lowered on reaching the next pier, and then the rear leg is moved.","sourceIds":["v13s-asbi-segmental-construction","v13s-pci-bang-na-2000","v13s-pci-muller-bridge-engineer-2006","v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-wiki-seven-mile-bridge"]},{"id":"b039-v13-17-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：架橋機本身很重，所以推進時不可能傾覆。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: A gantry is so heavy that it cannot overturn while launching. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v13s-asbi-segmental-construction","v13s-pci-bang-na-2000","v13s-pci-muller-bridge-engineer-2006","v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-wiki-seven-mile-bridge"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「架橋機推進、懸臂與防傾覆」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Gantry launching, cantilevering and overturning\" is correct?","options":["架橋機本身很重，所以推進時不可能傾覆。","張拉完成後只要拆除吊桿，荷重自然會平均傳到四個支承。","架橋機完成一跨後，要把主桁推向下一座橋墩：推進過程中主桁前端有一段很長的懸臂，重心必須始終位於後支點之內，否則整機前傾。"],"optionsEn":["A gantry is so heavy that it cannot overturn while launching.","After stressing, removing the hangers automatically shares the load equally among the four bearings.","After completing a span, the gantry girder must be pushed to the next pier."],"answer":2,"explanation":"架橋機完成一跨後，要把主桁推向下一座橋墩：推進過程中主桁前端有一段很長的懸臂，重心必須始終位於後支點之內，否則整機前傾。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"After completing a span, the gantry girder must be pushed to the next pier; during launching its front end becomes a long cantilever, and the centre of gravity must always stay inside the rear support or the machine tips forward. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":5,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":17},{"id":"b039-v13-18","title":"架橋機推進、懸臂與防傾覆：定量估算","titleEn":"Gantry launching, cantilevering and overturning: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-asbi-segmental-construction","v13s-pci-bang-na-2000","v13s-pci-muller-bridge-engineer-2006","v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-wiki-seven-mile-bridge"],"prerequisiteIds":["b039-v13-17"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「架橋機推進穩定」的關鍵量，並判斷跨度、荷載、溫度或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Gantry launching stability” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when span, load, temperature or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：主桁均布重 q = 60 kN/m，後段 50 m、前懸臂 42 m：傾覆彎矩 M_o = 60×42²/2 = 52,920 kN·m，抵抗彎矩 M_r = 60×50²/2 = 75,000 kN·m，安全係數 75,000/52,920 ≈ 1.42。若要求 1.5，需增加 1.5×52,920 − 75,000 = 4,380 kN·m，於後端 50 m 處加配重 4,380/50 ≈ 88 kN。數值為教學假設。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: With a girder weight q = 60 kN/m, 50 m behind the pivot and a 42 m front cantilever: overturning moment M_o = 60×42²/2 = 52,920 kN·m, restoring moment M_r = 60×50²/2 = 75,000 kN·m, factor 75,000/52,920 ≈ 1.42. To reach 1.5, add 1.5×52,920 − 75,000 = 4,380 kN·m, i.e. a counterweight of 4,380/50 ≈ 88 kN at the rear end. Values are teaching assumptions. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：推進前依檢查表確認：風速低於上限、支腿與軌道錨定、配重位置、液壓與制動系統、前支腿與下一墩的對位標記；推進中由專人監看前端下撓與後支點反力讀值，若反力接近零（將失去抵抗）立即停止。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Before launching, a checklist confirms wind below the limit, leg and rail anchorage, counterweight position, hydraulic and braking systems, and alignment marks between the front leg and the next pier; during launching an assigned person watches front-end deflection and rear-support reaction readings, and stops immediately if the rear reaction approaches zero.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b039-v13-18-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"主桁均布重 q = 60 kN/m，後段 50 m、前懸臂 42 m：傾覆彎矩 M_o = 60×42²/2 = 52,920 kN·m，抵抗彎矩 M_r = 60×50²/2 = 75,000 kN·m，安全係數 75,000/52,920 ≈ 1.42。若要求 1.5，需增加 1.5×52,920 − 75,000 = 4,380 kN·m，於後端 50 m 處加配重 4,380/50 ≈ 88 kN。數值為教學假設。","textEn":"With a girder weight q = 60 kN/m, 50 m behind the pivot and a 42 m front cantilever: overturning moment M_o = 60×42²/2 = 52,920 kN·m, restoring moment M_r = 60×50²/2 = 75,000 kN·m, factor 75,000/52,920 ≈ 1.42. To reach 1.5, add 1.5×52,920 − 75,000 = 4,380 kN·m, i.e. a counterweight of 4,380/50 ≈ 88 kN at the rear end. Values are teaching assumptions.","sourceIds":["v13s-asbi-segmental-construction","v13s-pci-bang-na-2000","v13s-pci-muller-bridge-engineer-2006","v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-wiki-seven-mile-bridge"]},{"id":"b039-v13-18-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v13s-asbi-segmental-construction","v13s-pci-bang-na-2000","v13s-pci-muller-bridge-engineer-2006","v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-wiki-seven-mile-bridge"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「架橋機推進、懸臂與防傾覆」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Gantry launching, cantilevering and overturning\", which statement holds?","options":["主桁均布重 q = 60 kN/m，後段 50 m、前懸臂 42 m：傾覆彎矩 M_o = 60×42²/2 = 52,920 kN·m，抵抗彎矩 M_r = 60×50²/2 = 75,000 kN·m，安全係數 75,000/52,920 ≈ 1.42。","體外鋼腱張拉完成後力量不會改變，所以不需要再量測。","接縫出現滲水只是防水問題，與結構無關。"],"optionsEn":["With a girder weight q = 60 kN/m, 50 m behind the pivot and a 42 m front cantilever: overturning moment M_o = 60×42²/2 = 52,920 kN·m, restoring moment M_r = 60×50²/2 = 75,000 kN·m, factor 75,000/52,920 ≈ 1.42.","Once stressed, an external tendon's force never changes, so it need not be measured again.","Water seeping at a segment joint is only a waterproofing issue with no structural meaning."],"answer":0,"explanation":"主桁均布重 q = 60 kN/m，後段 50 m、前懸臂 42 m：傾覆彎矩 M_o = 60×42²/2 = 52,920 kN·m，抵抗彎矩 M_r = 60×50²/2 = 75,000 kN·m，安全係數 75,000/52,920 ≈ 1.42。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"With a girder weight q = 60 kN/m, 50 m behind the pivot and a 42 m front cantilever: overturning moment M_o = 60×42²/2 = 52,920 kN·m, restoring moment M_r = 60×50²/2 = 75,000 kN·m, factor 75,000/52,920 ≈ 1.42. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":5,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":18},{"id":"b039-v13-19","title":"架橋機推進、懸臂與防傾覆：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Gantry launching, cantilevering and overturning: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-asbi-segmental-construction","v13s-pci-bang-na-2000","v13s-pci-muller-bridge-engineer-2006","v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-wiki-seven-mile-bridge"],"prerequisiteIds":["b039-v13-18"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「架橋機推進穩定」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Gantry launching stability” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"推進前依檢查表確認：風速低於上限、支腿與軌道錨定、配重位置、液壓與制動系統、前支腿與下一墩的對位標記；推進中由專人監看前端下撓與後支點反力讀值，若反力接近零（將失去抵抗）立即停止。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Before launching, a checklist confirms wind below the limit, leg and rail anchorage, counterweight position, hydraulic and braking systems, and alignment marks between the front leg and the next pier; during launching an assigned person watches front-end deflection and rear-support reaction readings, and stops immediately if the rear reaction approaches zero. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：架橋機的組立、首次推進與每次推進列為停留點，須由架橋機設計者提供推進程序與安全係數計算，並由專業技師與監造簽認；颱風季應訂定停機錨定程序與撤離條件。","observationEn":"Site practice: Gantry assembly, first launch and every launch are hold points; the gantry designer must provide the launching procedure and stability calculation, signed off by a qualified engineer and the supervising engineer, and a parking, anchoring and evacuation procedure is set for the typhoon season.","failure":"注意干擾：推進時忘記把上一跨的配重或吊具移回後端，或在超過風速限制時強行推進，主桁前傾觸及下一墩或墜落；在彎道或縱坡上推進而未設側向與下滑止擋，也曾導致架橋機滑移出軌。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、日照與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: Forgetting to move counterweights or lifting gear back after the previous span, or pushing beyond the wind limit, can tip the girder onto the next pier or drop it; launching on curves or gradients without lateral and downhill stops has also let gantries slide off their rails. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, sunshine and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b039-v13-19-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"推進前依檢查表確認：風速低於上限、支腿與軌道錨定、配重位置、液壓與制動系統、前支腿與下一墩的對位標記；推進中由專人監看前端下撓與後支點反力讀值，若反力接近零（將失去抵抗）立即停止。","textEn":"Before launching, a checklist confirms wind below the limit, leg and rail anchorage, counterweight position, hydraulic and braking systems, and alignment marks between the front leg and the next pier; during launching an assigned person watches front-end deflection and rear-support reaction readings, and stops immediately if the rear reaction approaches zero.","sourceIds":["v13s-asbi-segmental-construction","v13s-pci-bang-na-2000","v13s-pci-muller-bridge-engineer-2006","v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-wiki-seven-mile-bridge"]},{"id":"b039-v13-19-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"架橋機的組立、首次推進與每次推進列為停留點，須由架橋機設計者提供推進程序與安全係數計算，並由專業技師與監造簽認；颱風季應訂定停機錨定程序與撤離條件。","textEn":"Gantry assembly, first launch and every launch are hold points; the gantry designer must provide the launching procedure and stability calculation, signed off by a qualified engineer and the supervising engineer, and a parking, anchoring and evacuation procedure is set for the typhoon season.","sourceIds":["v13s-asbi-segmental-construction","v13s-pci-bang-na-2000","v13s-pci-muller-bridge-engineer-2006","v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-wiki-seven-mile-bridge"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「架橋機推進、懸臂與防傾覆」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Gantry launching, cantilevering and overturning\"?","options":["允收準則可以等看到量測數據後再決定。","推進前依檢查表確認：風速低於上限、支腿與軌道錨定、配重位置、液壓與制動系統、前支腿與下一墩的對位標記。","架橋機的荷重只是暫時的，橋墩照營運荷載設計就足夠。"],"optionsEn":["Acceptance criteria can be decided after the measured data have been seen.","Before launching, a checklist confirms wind below the limit, leg and rail anchorage, counterweight position, hydraulic and braking systems, and alignment marks between the front leg and the next pier.","Gantry loads are only temporary, so piers designed for service loads are always sufficient."],"answer":1,"explanation":"推進前依檢查表確認：風速低於上限、支腿與軌道錨定、配重位置、液壓與制動系統、前支腿與下一墩的對位標記；推進中由專人監看前端下撓與後支點反力讀值，若反力接近零（將失去抵抗）立即停止。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Before launching, a checklist confirms wind below the limit, leg and rail anchorage, counterweight position, hydraulic and braking systems, and alignment marks between the front leg and the next pier; during launching an assigned person watches front-end deflection and rear-support reaction readings, and stops immediately if the rear reaction approaches zero. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":5,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":19},{"id":"b039-v13-20","title":"架橋機推進、懸臂與防傾覆：失效診斷","titleEn":"Gantry launching, cantilevering and overturning: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-asbi-segmental-construction","v13s-pci-bang-na-2000","v13s-pci-muller-bridge-engineer-2006","v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-wiki-seven-mile-bridge"],"prerequisiteIds":["b039-v13-19"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「架橋機推進穩定」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Gantry launching stability” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"推進時忘記把上一跨的配重或吊具移回後端，或在超過風速限制時強行推進，主桁前傾觸及下一墩或墜落；在彎道或縱坡上推進而未設側向與下滑止擋，也曾導致架橋機滑移出軌。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"Forgetting to move counterweights or lifting gear back after the previous span, or pushing beyond the wind limit, can tip the girder onto the next pier or drop it; launching on curves or gradients without lateral and downhill stops has also let gantries slide off their rails. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：推進作業的風速限制、縱坡與彎道造成的側向分力、以及支腿與墩頂的錨定，都是決定能否安全推進的條件。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Wind-speed limits, longitudinal gradient, lateral components on curves and the anchorage of legs to the pier top all decide whether launching is safe.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「架橋機本身很重，所以推進時不可能傾覆。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"A gantry is so heavy that it cannot overturn while launching.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b039-v13-20-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"推進時忘記把上一跨的配重或吊具移回後端，或在超過風速限制時強行推進，主桁前傾觸及下一墩或墜落；在彎道或縱坡上推進而未設側向與下滑止擋，也曾導致架橋機滑移出軌。","textEn":"Forgetting to move counterweights or lifting gear back after the previous span, or pushing beyond the wind limit, can tip the girder onto the next pier or drop it; launching on curves or gradients without lateral and downhill stops has also let gantries slide off their rails.","sourceIds":["v13s-asbi-segmental-construction","v13s-pci-bang-na-2000","v13s-pci-muller-bridge-engineer-2006","v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-wiki-seven-mile-bridge"]},{"id":"b039-v13-20-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v13s-asbi-segmental-construction","v13s-pci-bang-na-2000","v13s-pci-muller-bridge-engineer-2006","v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-wiki-seven-mile-bridge"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「架橋機推進、懸臂與防傾覆」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Gantry launching, cantilevering and overturning\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["症狀相同就代表原因相同，不必用量測區分。","張拉完成後只要拆除吊桿，荷重自然會平均傳到四個支承。","推進時忘記把上一跨的配重或吊具移回後端，或在超過風速限制時強行推進，主桁前傾觸及下一墩或墜落；在彎道或縱坡上推進而未設側向與下滑止擋，也曾導致架橋機滑移出軌。"],"optionsEn":["Identical symptoms always mean identical causes, so no discriminating measurement is needed.","After stressing, removing the hangers automatically shares the load equally among the four bearings.","Forgetting to move counterweights or lifting gear back after the previous span, or pushing beyond the wind limit, can tip the girder onto the next pier or drop it."],"answer":2,"explanation":"推進時忘記把上一跨的配重或吊具移回後端，或在超過風速限制時強行推進，主桁前傾觸及下一墩或墜落；在彎道或縱坡上推進而未設側向與下滑止擋，也曾導致架橋機滑移出軌。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Forgetting to move counterweights or lifting gear back after the previous span, or pushing beyond the wind limit, can tip the girder onto the next pier or drop it; launching on curves or gradients without lateral and downhill stops has also let gantries slide off their rails. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":5,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":20},{"id":"b039-v13-21","title":"整跨組裝、張拉與荷重轉換：機制與傳力路徑","titleEn":"Span assembly, stressing and load transfer: mechanism and load path","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-asbi-segmental-construction","v13s-pci-bang-na-2000","v13s-pci-muller-bridge-engineer-2006","v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-wiki-seven-mile-bridge"],"prerequisiteIds":["b039-v13-20"],"objective":"說明「整跨荷重轉換」如何影響橋梁逐跨預鑄節塊架設的受力、變形或耐久表現，並畫出荷載的來源、傳遞路徑與支承邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Whole-span load transfer” governs force, deformation or durability in “Span-by-span precast bridge erection”, and map where loads come from, how they travel and where they are supported.","instruction":"節塊依序吊掛到架橋機後，先以吊桿或千斤頂調整每一塊的高程、橫坡與接縫間隙，使整跨符合預定的預拱線形；墩頂常留一道現澆濕接縫吸收累積誤差。張拉完成時，梁體因預力上拱而逐漸離開吊桿，荷重從架橋機轉移到永久支承。若轉換過程不同步，部分吊桿突然卸載或過載，梁端支承也可能一端先受力，造成扭轉與支承偏壓。 師傅任務：以自由體圖或傳力路徑圖畫出荷載如何經過「整跨荷重轉換」傳到支承或基礎，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Segments are hung on the gantry in sequence, and hangers or jacks adjust each one's level, cross-fall and joint gap so the span follows the intended camber; a cast-in-place wet joint at the pier often absorbs accumulated error. As stressing completes, the girder cambers up off the hangers and its weight transfers from the gantry to the permanent bearings. If the transfer is not synchronised, some hangers unload or overload suddenly and one end bearing may pick up load first, causing twist and uneven bearing pressure. Mentor task: draw a free-body or load-path diagram showing how loads pass through “Whole-span load transfer” to the supports or foundation, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：以等偏心近似，預力上拱 δ_P = P·e·L²/(8EI)，自重下撓 δ_g = 5wL⁴/(384EI)。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: With a constant-eccentricity approximation, prestress camber δ_P = P·e·L²/(8EI) and self-weight deflection δ_g = 5wL⁴/(384EI).","failure":"常見誤解：「張拉完成後只要拆除吊桿，荷重自然會平均傳到四個支承。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在傳力圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"After stressing, removing the hangers automatically shares the load equally among the four bearings.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your load-path diagram where it breaks down.","check":"傳力圖標明「整跨荷重轉換」的荷載來源、傳遞路徑與支承；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The load-path diagram shows load sources, path and supports for “Whole-span load transfer”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b039-v13-21-k1","title":"整跨組裝、張拉與荷重轉換","titleEn":"Span assembly, stressing and load transfer","text":"節塊依序吊掛到架橋機後，先以吊桿或千斤頂調整每一塊的高程、橫坡與接縫間隙，使整跨符合預定的預拱線形；墩頂常留一道現澆濕接縫吸收累積誤差。張拉完成時，梁體因預力上拱而逐漸離開吊桿，荷重從架橋機轉移到永久支承。","textEn":"Segments are hung on the gantry in sequence, and hangers or jacks adjust each one's level, cross-fall and joint gap so the span follows the intended camber; a cast-in-place wet joint at the pier often absorbs accumulated error. As stressing completes, the girder cambers up off the hangers and its weight transfers from the gantry to the permanent bearings.","sourceIds":["v13s-asbi-segmental-construction","v13s-pci-bang-na-2000","v13s-pci-muller-bridge-engineer-2006","v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-wiki-seven-mile-bridge"]},{"id":"b039-v13-21-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：張拉完成後只要拆除吊桿，荷重自然會平均傳到四個支承。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: After stressing, removing the hangers automatically shares the load equally among the four bearings. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v13s-asbi-segmental-construction","v13s-pci-bang-na-2000","v13s-pci-muller-bridge-engineer-2006","v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-wiki-seven-mile-bridge"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「整跨組裝、張拉與荷重轉換」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Span assembly, stressing and load transfer\" is correct?","options":["節塊依序吊掛到架橋機後，先以吊桿或千斤頂調整每一塊的高程、橫坡與接縫間隙，使整跨符合預定的預拱線形；墩頂常留一道現澆濕接縫吸收累積誤差。","張拉完成後只要拆除吊桿，荷重自然會平均傳到四個支承。","預製場的模板精度夠高，就不需要逐塊量測幾何。"],"optionsEn":["Segments are hung on the gantry in sequence, and hangers or jacks adjust each one's level, cross-fall and joint gap so the span follows the intended camber.","After stressing, removing the hangers automatically shares the load equally among the four bearings.","If the yard forms are accurate enough, segment geometry need not be surveyed one by one."],"answer":0,"explanation":"節塊依序吊掛到架橋機後，先以吊桿或千斤頂調整每一塊的高程、橫坡與接縫間隙，使整跨符合預定的預拱線形；墩頂常留一道現澆濕接縫吸收累積誤差。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Segments are hung on the gantry in sequence, and hangers or jacks adjust each one's level, cross-fall and joint gap so the span follows the intended camber; a cast-in-place wet joint at the pier often absorbs accumulated error. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":6,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":21},{"id":"b039-v13-22","title":"整跨組裝、張拉與荷重轉換：定量估算","titleEn":"Span assembly, stressing and load transfer: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-asbi-segmental-construction","v13s-pci-bang-na-2000","v13s-pci-muller-bridge-engineer-2006","v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-wiki-seven-mile-bridge"],"prerequisiteIds":["b039-v13-21"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「整跨荷重轉換」的關鍵量，並判斷跨度、荷載、溫度或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Whole-span load transfer” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when span, load, temperature or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：以等偏心近似，預力上拱 δ_P = P·e·L²/(8EI)，自重下撓 δ_g = 5wL⁴/(384EI)。EI = 35,000 MPa × 3.0 m⁴ = 1.05×10⁸ kN·m²：δ_P = 43,200×1.0×42²/(8×1.05×10⁸) ≈ 90.7 mm，δ_g = 5×180×42⁴/(384×1.05×10⁸) ≈ 69.5 mm，淨上拱約 21 mm，表示梁體會自行離開吊桿。數值為教學假設。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: With a constant-eccentricity approximation, prestress camber δ_P = P·e·L²/(8EI) and self-weight deflection δ_g = 5wL⁴/(384EI). For EI = 35,000 MPa × 3.0 m⁴ = 1.05×10⁸ kN·m², δ_P = 43,200×1.0×42²/(8×1.05×10⁸) ≈ 90.7 mm and δ_g = 5×180×42⁴/(384×1.05×10⁸) ≈ 69.5 mm, a net upward camber of about 21 mm, so the girder lifts itself off the hangers. Values are teaching assumptions. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：張拉依設計順序左右對稱分級進行，每一級記錄吊桿荷重、梁端高程與跨中高程；最終淨上拱與計算值比較（例如偏差超過 ±20% 即暫停查明），並確認四個支承都已受力、無懸空。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Stress symmetrically in design order and in stages, recording hanger loads, end levels and midspan level at each stage; compare the final net camber with calculation, pausing to investigate if it deviates by more than, for example, ±20%, and confirm all four bearings carry load with none hanging free.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b039-v13-22-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"以等偏心近似，預力上拱 δ_P = P·e·L²/(8EI)，自重下撓 δ_g = 5wL⁴/(384EI)。EI = 35,000 MPa × 3.0 m⁴ = 1.05×10⁸ kN·m²：δ_P = 43,200×1.0×42²/(8×1.05×10⁸) ≈ 90.7 mm，δ_g = 5×180×42⁴/(384×1.05×10⁸) ≈ 69.5 mm，淨上拱約 21 mm，表示梁體會自行離開吊桿。數值為教學假設。","textEn":"With a constant-eccentricity approximation, prestress camber δ_P = P·e·L²/(8EI) and self-weight deflection δ_g = 5wL⁴/(384EI). For EI = 35,000 MPa × 3.0 m⁴ = 1.05×10⁸ kN·m², δ_P = 43,200×1.0×42²/(8×1.05×10⁸) ≈ 90.7 mm and δ_g = 5×180×42⁴/(384×1.05×10⁸) ≈ 69.5 mm, a net upward camber of about 21 mm, so the girder lifts itself off the hangers. Values are teaching assumptions.","sourceIds":["v13s-asbi-segmental-construction","v13s-pci-bang-na-2000","v13s-pci-muller-bridge-engineer-2006","v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-wiki-seven-mile-bridge"]},{"id":"b039-v13-22-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v13s-asbi-segmental-construction","v13s-pci-bang-na-2000","v13s-pci-muller-bridge-engineer-2006","v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-wiki-seven-mile-bridge"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「整跨組裝、張拉與荷重轉換」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Span assembly, stressing and load transfer\", which statement holds?","options":["體外鋼腱有 HDPE 套管保護，所以不會腐蝕。","以等偏心近似，預力上拱 δ_P = P·e·L²/(8EI)，自重下撓 δ_g = 5wL⁴/(384EI)。","逐跨架設的節塊接縫在營運時可以像鋼筋混凝土一樣容許開裂。"],"optionsEn":["External tendons in HDPE sheaths cannot corrode.","With a constant-eccentricity approximation, prestress camber δ_P = P·e·L²/(8EI) and self-weight deflection δ_g = 5wL⁴/(384EI).","Joints in span-by-span segmental spans may crack in service just like reinforced concrete."],"answer":1,"explanation":"以等偏心近似，預力上拱 δ_P = P·e·L²/(8EI)，自重下撓 δ_g = 5wL⁴/(384EI)。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"With a constant-eccentricity approximation, prestress camber δ_P = P·e·L²/(8EI) and self-weight deflection δ_g = 5wL⁴/(384EI). Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":6,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":22},{"id":"b039-v13-23","title":"整跨組裝、張拉與荷重轉換：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Span assembly, stressing and load transfer: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-asbi-segmental-construction","v13s-pci-bang-na-2000","v13s-pci-muller-bridge-engineer-2006","v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-wiki-seven-mile-bridge"],"prerequisiteIds":["b039-v13-22"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「整跨荷重轉換」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Whole-span load transfer” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"張拉依設計順序左右對稱分級進行，每一級記錄吊桿荷重、梁端高程與跨中高程；最終淨上拱與計算值比較（例如偏差超過 ±20% 即暫停查明），並確認四個支承都已受力、無懸空。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Stress symmetrically in design order and in stages, recording hanger loads, end levels and midspan level at each stage; compare the final net camber with calculation, pausing to investigate if it deviates by more than, for example, ±20%, and confirm all four bearings carry load with none hanging free. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：架設程序書要包含節塊吊掛順序、線形調整允差、濕接縫澆置條件、張拉順序與吊桿卸載步驟，荷重轉換列為停留點；支承墊石高程在架設前複測並留下紀錄。","observationEn":"Site practice: The erection procedure should include segment hanging order, alignment tolerances, wet-joint casting conditions, stressing order and hanger release steps, with load transfer as a hold point; bearing plinth levels are re-surveyed and recorded before erection.","failure":"注意干擾：若單側鋼腱先全部張拉，箱梁產生側彎與扭轉，接縫一側張開；支承墊石高程不一時，張拉後一個支承懸空，梁體成為三點支承，在活載下搖動並使支承與墊石受衝擊損壞。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、日照與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: Stressing all tendons on one side first bends and twists the box sideways and opens joints on one side; uneven plinth levels leave one bearing unloaded after stressing, so the span rocks on three supports under traffic, hammering and damaging bearings and plinths. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, sunshine and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b039-v13-23-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"張拉依設計順序左右對稱分級進行，每一級記錄吊桿荷重、梁端高程與跨中高程；最終淨上拱與計算值比較（例如偏差超過 ±20% 即暫停查明），並確認四個支承都已受力、無懸空。","textEn":"Stress symmetrically in design order and in stages, recording hanger loads, end levels and midspan level at each stage; compare the final net camber with calculation, pausing to investigate if it deviates by more than, for example, ±20%, and confirm all four bearings carry load with none hanging free.","sourceIds":["v13s-asbi-segmental-construction","v13s-pci-bang-na-2000","v13s-pci-muller-bridge-engineer-2006","v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-wiki-seven-mile-bridge"]},{"id":"b039-v13-23-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"架設程序書要包含節塊吊掛順序、線形調整允差、濕接縫澆置條件、張拉順序與吊桿卸載步驟，荷重轉換列為停留點；支承墊石高程在架設前複測並留下紀錄。","textEn":"The erection procedure should include segment hanging order, alignment tolerances, wet-joint casting conditions, stressing order and hanger release steps, with load transfer as a hold point; bearing plinth levels are re-surveyed and recorded before erection.","sourceIds":["v13s-asbi-segmental-construction","v13s-pci-bang-na-2000","v13s-pci-muller-bridge-engineer-2006","v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-wiki-seven-mile-bridge"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「整跨組裝、張拉與荷重轉換」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Span assembly, stressing and load transfer\"?","options":["只要結構分析模型看起來合理，就可以省略現場量測與試驗。","乾接縫只是少塗一層環氧，結構行為與環氧接縫完全相同。","張拉依設計順序左右對稱分級進行，每一級記錄吊桿荷重、梁端高程與跨中高程。"],"optionsEn":["If the structural model looks reasonable, site measurement and testing can be skipped.","A dry joint is just an epoxy joint without the epoxy and behaves identically.","Stress symmetrically in design order and in stages, recording hanger loads, end levels and midspan level at each stage."],"answer":2,"explanation":"張拉依設計順序左右對稱分級進行，每一級記錄吊桿荷重、梁端高程與跨中高程；最終淨上拱與計算值比較（例如偏差超過 ±20% 即暫停查明），並確認四個支承都已受力、無懸空。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Stress symmetrically in design order and in stages, recording hanger loads, end levels and midspan level at each stage; compare the final net camber with calculation, pausing to investigate if it deviates by more than, for example, ±20%, and confirm all four bearings carry load with none hanging free. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":6,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":23},{"id":"b039-v13-24","title":"整跨組裝、張拉與荷重轉換：失效診斷","titleEn":"Span assembly, stressing and load transfer: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-asbi-segmental-construction","v13s-pci-bang-na-2000","v13s-pci-muller-bridge-engineer-2006","v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-wiki-seven-mile-bridge"],"prerequisiteIds":["b039-v13-23"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「整跨荷重轉換」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Whole-span load transfer” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"若單側鋼腱先全部張拉，箱梁產生側彎與扭轉，接縫一側張開；支承墊石高程不一時，張拉後一個支承懸空，梁體成為三點支承，在活載下搖動並使支承與墊石受衝擊損壞。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"Stressing all tendons on one side first bends and twists the box sideways and opens joints on one side; uneven plinth levels leave one bearing unloaded after stressing, so the span rocks on three supports under traffic, hammering and damaging bearings and plinths. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：若轉換過程不同步，部分吊桿突然卸載或過載，梁端支承也可能一端先受力，造成扭轉與支承偏壓。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: If the transfer is not synchronised, some hangers unload or overload suddenly and one end bearing may pick up load first, causing twist and uneven bearing pressure.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「張拉完成後只要拆除吊桿，荷重自然會平均傳到四個支承。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"After stressing, removing the hangers automatically shares the load equally among the four bearings.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b039-v13-24-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"若單側鋼腱先全部張拉，箱梁產生側彎與扭轉，接縫一側張開；支承墊石高程不一時，張拉後一個支承懸空，梁體成為三點支承，在活載下搖動並使支承與墊石受衝擊損壞。","textEn":"Stressing all tendons on one side first bends and twists the box sideways and opens joints on one side; uneven plinth levels leave one bearing unloaded after stressing, so the span rocks on three supports under traffic, hammering and damaging bearings and plinths.","sourceIds":["v13s-asbi-segmental-construction","v13s-pci-bang-na-2000","v13s-pci-muller-bridge-engineer-2006","v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-wiki-seven-mile-bridge"]},{"id":"b039-v13-24-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v13s-asbi-segmental-construction","v13s-pci-bang-na-2000","v13s-pci-muller-bridge-engineer-2006","v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-wiki-seven-mile-bridge"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「整跨組裝、張拉與荷重轉換」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Span assembly, stressing and load transfer\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["若單側鋼腱先全部張拉，箱梁產生側彎與扭轉，接縫一側張開；支承墊石高程不一時，張拉後一個支承懸空，梁體成為三點支承，在活載下搖動並使支承與墊石受衝擊損壞。","只要結構還沒倒，就代表安全餘裕仍然足夠。","預製場的模板精度夠高，就不需要逐塊量測幾何。"],"optionsEn":["Stressing all tendons on one side first bends and twists the box sideways and opens joints on one side.","As long as the structure is still standing, its safety margin must still be adequate.","If the yard forms are accurate enough, segment geometry need not be surveyed one by one."],"answer":0,"explanation":"若單側鋼腱先全部張拉，箱梁產生側彎與扭轉，接縫一側張開；支承墊石高程不一時，張拉後一個支承懸空，梁體成為三點支承，在活載下搖動並使支承與墊石受衝擊損壞。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Stressing all tendons on one side first bends and twists the box sideways and opens joints on one side; uneven plinth levels leave one bearing unloaded after stressing, so the span rocks on three supports under traffic, hammering and damaging bearings and plinths. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":6,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":24}],"order":3},{"id":"b039-v13-s4","title":"試驗、量測與監測驗證","titleEn":"Testing, measurement and monitoring","description":"本階段聚焦「短線匹配澆注與平面曲線控制」與「體外鋼腱力量的驗收量測」：先建立傳力機制與定量模型，再設計試驗驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"Short-line match casting and curve control\" and \"Acceptance measurement of external tendon force\": build the load path and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"b039-v13-25","title":"短線匹配澆注與平面曲線控制：機制與傳力路徑","titleEn":"Short-line match casting and curve control: mechanism and load path","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-asbi-segmental-construction","v13s-pci-bang-na-2000","v13s-pci-muller-bridge-engineer-2006","v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-wiki-seven-mile-bridge"],"prerequisiteIds":["b039-v13-24"],"objective":"說明「預製場匹配幾何」如何影響橋梁逐跨預鑄節塊架設的受力、變形或耐久表現，並畫出荷載的來源、傳遞路徑與支承邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Casting-yard match geometry” governs force, deformation or durability in “Span-by-span precast bridge erection”, and map where loads come from, how they travel and where they are supported.","instruction":"大量逐跨節塊多在短線法預製台座生產：固定端模不動，前一節塊作為匹配節塊移到相對位置，再澆製新節塊。平面曲線、縱坡與超高都靠每次調整匹配節塊的位置與角度來達成，所以預製場幾何控制其實是在把橋梁的三維線形分解成每一個接縫的微小轉角。Bang Na 高架道路的預製場設有約 100 個澆注台座，月產能約 1,800 個節塊，量測與資料管理的規模與一般工程截然不同。 師傅任務：以自由體圖或傳力路徑圖畫出荷載如何經過「預製場匹配幾何」傳到支承或基礎，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"High-volume span-by-span segments are usually produced on short-line casting cells: the bulkhead stays fixed while the previously cast segment is moved into a relative position as the match-cast unit and the new segment is cast against it. Horizontal curves, gradients and superelevation are created by adjusting the position and angle of the match-cast unit each time, so yard geometry control decomposes the bridge's 3D alignment into small rotations at every joint. The Bang Na Expressway yard had about 100 casting cells with a capacity of about 1,800 segments per month, a scale of surveying and data management very different from ordinary jobs. Mentor task: draw a free-body or load-path diagram showing how loads pass through “Casting-yard match geometry” to the supports or foundation, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：平曲線半徑 R = 600 m、節塊長 s = 3.0 m：每接縫轉角 θ = s/R = 0.005 rad，節塊遠端相對切線的偏移 s²/(2R) = 9/1,200 = 7.5 mm；42 m 整跨的弦長與弧線中點差 L²/(8R) = 42²/4,800 ≈ 368 mm，決定箱內體外鋼腱與支承的平面位置。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: For a horizontal radius R = 600 m and segment length s = 3.0 m, each joint turns θ = s/R = 0.005 rad and the far end of a segment is offset s²/(2R) = 9/1,200 = 7.5 mm from the tangent; over a 42 m span the arc departs from the chord by L²/(8R) = 42²/4,800 ≈ 368 mm at midspan, which fixes the plan positions of external tendons and bearings.","failure":"常見誤解：「預製場的模板精度夠高，就不需要逐塊量測幾何。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在傳力圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"If the yard forms are accurate enough, segment geometry need not be surveyed one by one.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your load-path diagram where it breaks down.","check":"傳力圖標明「預製場匹配幾何」的荷載來源、傳遞路徑與支承；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The load-path diagram shows load sources, path and supports for “Casting-yard match geometry”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b039-v13-25-k1","title":"短線匹配澆注與平面曲線控制","titleEn":"Short-line match casting and curve control","text":"大量逐跨節塊多在短線法預製台座生產：固定端模不動，前一節塊作為匹配節塊移到相對位置，再澆製新節塊。平面曲線、縱坡與超高都靠每次調整匹配節塊的位置與角度來達成，所以預製場幾何控制其實是在把橋梁的三維線形分解成每一個接縫的微小轉角。","textEn":"High-volume span-by-span segments are usually produced on short-line casting cells: the bulkhead stays fixed while the previously cast segment is moved into a relative position as the match-cast unit and the new segment is cast against it. Horizontal curves, gradients and superelevation are created by adjusting the position and angle of the match-cast unit each time, so yard geometry control decomposes the bridge's 3D alignment into small rotations at every joint.","sourceIds":["v13s-asbi-segmental-construction","v13s-pci-bang-na-2000","v13s-pci-muller-bridge-engineer-2006","v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-wiki-seven-mile-bridge"]},{"id":"b039-v13-25-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：預製場的模板精度夠高，就不需要逐塊量測幾何。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: If the yard forms are accurate enough, segment geometry need not be surveyed one by one. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v13s-asbi-segmental-construction","v13s-pci-bang-na-2000","v13s-pci-muller-bridge-engineer-2006","v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-wiki-seven-mile-bridge"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「短線匹配澆注與平面曲線控制」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Short-line match casting and curve control\" is correct?","options":["預製場的模板精度夠高，就不需要逐塊量測幾何。","大量逐跨節塊多在短線法預製台座生產：固定端模不動，前一節塊作為匹配節塊移到相對位置，再澆製新節塊。","體外鋼腱張拉完成後力量不會改變，所以不需要再量測。"],"optionsEn":["If the yard forms are accurate enough, segment geometry need not be surveyed one by one.","High-volume span-by-span segments are usually produced on short-line casting cells: the bulkhead stays fixed while the previously cast segment is moved into a relative position as the match-cast unit and the new segment is cast against it.","Once stressed, an external tendon's force never changes, so it need not be measured again."],"answer":1,"explanation":"大量逐跨節塊多在短線法預製台座生產：固定端模不動，前一節塊作為匹配節塊移到相對位置，再澆製新節塊。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"High-volume span-by-span segments are usually produced on short-line casting cells: the bulkhead stays fixed while the previously cast segment is moved into a relative position as the match-cast unit and the new segment is cast against it. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":7,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":25},{"id":"b039-v13-26","title":"短線匹配澆注與平面曲線控制：定量估算","titleEn":"Short-line match casting and curve control: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-asbi-segmental-construction","v13s-pci-bang-na-2000","v13s-pci-muller-bridge-engineer-2006","v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-wiki-seven-mile-bridge"],"prerequisiteIds":["b039-v13-25"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「預製場匹配幾何」的關鍵量，並判斷跨度、荷載、溫度或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Casting-yard match geometry” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when span, load, temperature or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：平曲線半徑 R = 600 m、節塊長 s = 3.0 m：每接縫轉角 θ = s/R = 0.005 rad，節塊遠端相對切線的偏移 s²/(2R) = 9/1,200 = 7.5 mm；42 m 整跨的弦長與弧線中點差 L²/(8R) = 42²/4,800 ≈ 368 mm，決定箱內體外鋼腱與支承的平面位置。數值為教學假設。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: For a horizontal radius R = 600 m and segment length s = 3.0 m, each joint turns θ = s/R = 0.005 rad and the far end of a segment is offset s²/(2R) = 9/1,200 = 7.5 mm from the tangent; over a 42 m span the arc departs from the chord by L²/(8R) = 42²/4,800 ≈ 368 mm at midspan, which fixes the plan positions of external tendons and bearings. Values are teaching assumptions. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：每一節塊澆置前後由測量塔與固定控制點量測頂板控制點，計算實際轉角並與理論值比較，將誤差回饋到下一節塊的匹配位置（誤差不可累積）；每跨完成後計算整跨實際幾何，與設計線形比對並調整濕接縫。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Before and after each cast, survey top-slab control points from the survey tower and fixed benchmarks, compute the actual rotation and compare it with theory, feeding the error back into the next match position so errors do not accumulate; after each span, compute the as-cast span geometry, compare it with the design alignment and adjust the wet joint.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b039-v13-26-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"平曲線半徑 R = 600 m、節塊長 s = 3.0 m：每接縫轉角 θ = s/R = 0.005 rad，節塊遠端相對切線的偏移 s²/(2R) = 9/1,200 = 7.5 mm；42 m 整跨的弦長與弧線中點差 L²/(8R) = 42²/4,800 ≈ 368 mm，決定箱內體外鋼腱與支承的平面位置。數值為教學假設。","textEn":"For a horizontal radius R = 600 m and segment length s = 3.0 m, each joint turns θ = s/R = 0.005 rad and the far end of a segment is offset s²/(2R) = 9/1,200 = 7.5 mm from the tangent; over a 42 m span the arc departs from the chord by L²/(8R) = 42²/4,800 ≈ 368 mm at midspan, which fixes the plan positions of external tendons and bearings. Values are teaching assumptions.","sourceIds":["v13s-asbi-segmental-construction","v13s-pci-bang-na-2000","v13s-pci-muller-bridge-engineer-2006","v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-wiki-seven-mile-bridge"]},{"id":"b039-v13-26-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v13s-asbi-segmental-construction","v13s-pci-bang-na-2000","v13s-pci-muller-bridge-engineer-2006","v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-wiki-seven-mile-bridge"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「短線匹配澆注與平面曲線控制」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Short-line match casting and curve control\", which statement holds?","options":["接縫出現滲水只是防水問題，與結構無關。","架橋機的荷重只是暫時的，橋墩照營運荷載設計就足夠。","平曲線半徑 R = 600 m、節塊長 s = 3.0 m：每接縫轉角 θ = s/R = 0.005 rad，節塊遠端相對切線的偏移 s²/(2R) = 9/1,200 = 7.5 mm。"],"optionsEn":["Water seeping at a segment joint is only a waterproofing issue with no structural meaning.","Gantry loads are only temporary, so piers designed for service loads are always sufficient.","For a horizontal radius R = 600 m and segment length s = 3.0 m, each joint turns θ = s/R = 0.005 rad and the far end of a segment is offset s²/(2R) = 9/1,200 = 7.5 mm from the tangent."],"answer":2,"explanation":"平曲線半徑 R = 600 m、節塊長 s = 3.0 m：每接縫轉角 θ = s/R = 0.005 rad，節塊遠端相對切線的偏移 s²/(2R) = 9/1,200 = 7.5 mm；42 m 整跨的弦長與弧線中點差 L²/(8R) = 42²/4,800 ≈ 368 mm，決定箱內體外鋼腱與支承的平面位置。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"For a horizontal radius R = 600 m and segment length s = 3.0 m, each joint turns θ = s/R = 0.005 rad and the far end of a segment is offset s²/(2R) = 9/1,200 = 7.5 mm from the tangent; over a 42 m span the arc departs from the chord by L²/(8R) = 42²/4,800 ≈ 368 mm at midspan, which fixes the plan positions of external tendons and bearings. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":7,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":26},{"id":"b039-v13-27","title":"短線匹配澆注與平面曲線控制：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Short-line match casting and curve control: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-asbi-segmental-construction","v13s-pci-bang-na-2000","v13s-pci-muller-bridge-engineer-2006","v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-wiki-seven-mile-bridge"],"prerequisiteIds":["b039-v13-26"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「預製場匹配幾何」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Casting-yard match geometry” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"每一節塊澆置前後由測量塔與固定控制點量測頂板控制點，計算實際轉角並與理論值比較，將誤差回饋到下一節塊的匹配位置（誤差不可累積）；每跨完成後計算整跨實際幾何，與設計線形比對並調整濕接縫。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Before and after each cast, survey top-slab control points from the survey tower and fixed benchmarks, compute the actual rotation and compare it with theory, feeding the error back into the next match position so errors do not accumulate; after each span, compute the as-cast span geometry, compare it with the design alignment and adjust the wet joint. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：預製場應有獨立的幾何控制工程師與專用軟體，每節塊產出一份經簽認的幾何紀錄並以節塊編號追蹤到架設位置；測量塔與控制點每月複核穩定性。","observationEn":"Site practice: The yard needs an independent geometry-control engineer and dedicated software, with a signed geometry record for every segment traced by segment number to its erected position; survey towers and benchmarks are checked for stability monthly.","failure":"注意干擾：若預製場只照理論座標擺放匹配節塊而不回饋實測誤差，誤差逐塊累積，到現場整跨無法對準支承或下一跨，只能加大濕接縫或修鑿節塊，甚至報廢重做。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、日照與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: Placing match units by theoretical coordinates without feeding back measured errors lets errors accumulate segment by segment, so on site the span misses its bearings or the next span and needs a wider wet joint, grinding, or even a scrapped segment. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, sunshine and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b039-v13-27-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"每一節塊澆置前後由測量塔與固定控制點量測頂板控制點，計算實際轉角並與理論值比較，將誤差回饋到下一節塊的匹配位置（誤差不可累積）；每跨完成後計算整跨實際幾何，與設計線形比對並調整濕接縫。","textEn":"Before and after each cast, survey top-slab control points from the survey tower and fixed benchmarks, compute the actual rotation and compare it with theory, feeding the error back into the next match position so errors do not accumulate; after each span, compute the as-cast span geometry, compare it with the design alignment and adjust the wet joint.","sourceIds":["v13s-asbi-segmental-construction","v13s-pci-bang-na-2000","v13s-pci-muller-bridge-engineer-2006","v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-wiki-seven-mile-bridge"]},{"id":"b039-v13-27-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"預製場應有獨立的幾何控制工程師與專用軟體，每節塊產出一份經簽認的幾何紀錄並以節塊編號追蹤到架設位置；測量塔與控制點每月複核穩定性。","textEn":"The yard needs an independent geometry-control engineer and dedicated software, with a signed geometry record for every segment traced by segment number to its erected position; survey towers and benchmarks are checked for stability monthly.","sourceIds":["v13s-asbi-segmental-construction","v13s-pci-bang-na-2000","v13s-pci-muller-bridge-engineer-2006","v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-wiki-seven-mile-bridge"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「短線匹配澆注與平面曲線控制」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Short-line match casting and curve control\"?","options":["每一節塊澆置前後由測量塔與固定控制點量測頂板控制點，計算實際轉角並與理論值比較，將誤差回饋到下一節塊的匹配位置（誤差不可累積）。","量測時不必記錄溫度、日照、風與施工荷重，因為它們不會影響結果。","體外鋼腱不埋在混凝土裡，所以轉向塊只需要很少的鋼筋。"],"optionsEn":["Before and after each cast, survey top-slab control points from the survey tower and fixed benchmarks, compute the actual rotation and compare it with theory, feeding the error back into the next match position so errors do not accumulate.","Temperature, sunshine, wind and construction loads need not be recorded because they cannot affect the result.","Because external tendons are not embedded, deviators need very little reinforcement."],"answer":0,"explanation":"每一節塊澆置前後由測量塔與固定控制點量測頂板控制點，計算實際轉角並與理論值比較，將誤差回饋到下一節塊的匹配位置（誤差不可累積）；每跨完成後計算整跨實際幾何，與設計線形比對並調整濕接縫。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Before and after each cast, survey top-slab control points from the survey tower and fixed benchmarks, compute the actual rotation and compare it with theory, feeding the error back into the next match position so errors do not accumulate; after each span, compute the as-cast span geometry, compare it with the design alignment and adjust the wet joint. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":7,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":27},{"id":"b039-v13-28","title":"短線匹配澆注與平面曲線控制：失效診斷","titleEn":"Short-line match casting and curve control: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-asbi-segmental-construction","v13s-pci-bang-na-2000","v13s-pci-muller-bridge-engineer-2006","v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-wiki-seven-mile-bridge"],"prerequisiteIds":["b039-v13-27"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「預製場匹配幾何」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Casting-yard match geometry” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"若預製場只照理論座標擺放匹配節塊而不回饋實測誤差，誤差逐塊累積，到現場整跨無法對準支承或下一跨，只能加大濕接縫或修鑿節塊，甚至報廢重做。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"Placing match units by theoretical coordinates without feeding back measured errors lets errors accumulate segment by segment, so on site the span misses its bearings or the next span and needs a wider wet joint, grinding, or even a scrapped segment. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：Bang Na 高架道路的預製場設有約 100 個澆注台座，月產能約 1,800 個節塊，量測與資料管理的規模與一般工程截然不同。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: The Bang Na Expressway yard had about 100 casting cells with a capacity of about 1,800 segments per month, a scale of surveying and data management very different from ordinary jobs.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「預製場的模板精度夠高，就不需要逐塊量測幾何。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"If the yard forms are accurate enough, segment geometry need not be surveyed one by one.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b039-v13-28-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"若預製場只照理論座標擺放匹配節塊而不回饋實測誤差，誤差逐塊累積，到現場整跨無法對準支承或下一跨，只能加大濕接縫或修鑿節塊，甚至報廢重做。","textEn":"Placing match units by theoretical coordinates without feeding back measured errors lets errors accumulate segment by segment, so on site the span misses its bearings or the next span and needs a wider wet joint, grinding, or even a scrapped segment.","sourceIds":["v13s-asbi-segmental-construction","v13s-pci-bang-na-2000","v13s-pci-muller-bridge-engineer-2006","v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-wiki-seven-mile-bridge"]},{"id":"b039-v13-28-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v13s-asbi-segmental-construction","v13s-pci-bang-na-2000","v13s-pci-muller-bridge-engineer-2006","v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-wiki-seven-mile-bridge"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「短線匹配澆注與平面曲線控制」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Short-line match casting and curve control\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["所有異常都來自施工人員失誤，設計與細部不需要檢討。","若預製場只照理論座標擺放匹配節塊而不回饋實測誤差，誤差逐塊累積，到現場整跨無法對準支承或下一跨，只能加大濕接縫或修鑿節塊，甚至報廢重做。","體外鋼腱張拉完成後力量不會改變，所以不需要再量測。"],"optionsEn":["Every anomaly is a workmanship error, so design and detailing never need review.","Placing match units by theoretical coordinates without feeding back measured errors lets errors accumulate segment by segment, so on site the span misses its bearings or the next span and needs a wider wet joint, grinding, or even a scrapped segment.","Once stressed, an external tendon's force never changes, so it need not be measured again."],"answer":1,"explanation":"若預製場只照理論座標擺放匹配節塊而不回饋實測誤差，誤差逐塊累積，到現場整跨無法對準支承或下一跨，只能加大濕接縫或修鑿節塊，甚至報廢重做。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Placing match units by theoretical coordinates without feeding back measured errors lets errors accumulate segment by segment, so on site the span misses its bearings or the next span and needs a wider wet joint, grinding, or even a scrapped segment. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":7,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":28},{"id":"b039-v13-29","title":"體外鋼腱力量的驗收量測：機制與傳力路徑","titleEn":"Acceptance measurement of external tendon force: mechanism and load path","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-asbi-segmental-construction","v13s-pci-bang-na-2000","v13s-pci-muller-bridge-engineer-2006","v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-wiki-seven-mile-bridge"],"prerequisiteIds":["b039-v13-28"],"objective":"說明「體外鋼腱振動頻率」如何影響橋梁逐跨預鑄節塊架設的受力、變形或耐久表現，並畫出荷載的來源、傳遞路徑與支承邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “External tendon vibration frequency” governs force, deformation or durability in “Span-by-span precast bridge erection”, and map where loads come from, how they travel and where they are supported.","instruction":"體外鋼腱在轉向塊之間是一段自由的張緊索，它的橫向自然頻率與張力直接相關，因此可以在張拉後以加速度計輕敲量測頻率，反算每一束的有效力，作為千斤頂讀值與伸長量之外的第三種獨立驗證。這個方法也能在營運期重複使用，追蹤預力損失或發現斷絲。量測需考慮套管與灌漿質量、端部約束與鋼腱抗彎勁度的影響，最好先以舉離試驗校正。 師傅任務：以自由體圖或傳力路徑圖畫出荷載如何經過「體外鋼腱振動頻率」傳到支承或基礎，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Between deviators an external tendon is a free taut cable whose lateral natural frequency relates directly to its tension, so after stressing a light tap and an accelerometer give the frequency and hence the effective force of every tendon, a third independent check beyond jack readings and elongation. The same method can be repeated in service to track prestress loss or detect broken wires. The measurement must account for the mass of sheath and grout, end restraint and tendon bending stiffness, ideally calibrated first by a lift-off test. Mentor task: draw a free-body or load-path diagram showing how loads pass through “External tendon vibration frequency” to the supports or foundation, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：張緊弦 T = 4·m·L²·f²。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Taut string T = 4·m·L²·f².","failure":"常見誤解：「體外鋼腱張拉完成後力量不會改變，所以不需要再量測。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在傳力圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Once stressed, an external tendon's force never changes, so it need not be measured again.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your load-path diagram where it breaks down.","check":"傳力圖標明「體外鋼腱振動頻率」的荷載來源、傳遞路徑與支承；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The load-path diagram shows load sources, path and supports for “External tendon vibration frequency”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b039-v13-29-k1","title":"體外鋼腱力量的驗收量測","titleEn":"Acceptance measurement of external tendon force","text":"體外鋼腱在轉向塊之間是一段自由的張緊索，它的橫向自然頻率與張力直接相關，因此可以在張拉後以加速度計輕敲量測頻率，反算每一束的有效力，作為千斤頂讀值與伸長量之外的第三種獨立驗證。這個方法也能在營運期重複使用，追蹤預力損失或發現斷絲。","textEn":"Between deviators an external tendon is a free taut cable whose lateral natural frequency relates directly to its tension, so after stressing a light tap and an accelerometer give the frequency and hence the effective force of every tendon, a third independent check beyond jack readings and elongation. The same method can be repeated in service to track prestress loss or detect broken wires.","sourceIds":["v13s-asbi-segmental-construction","v13s-pci-bang-na-2000","v13s-pci-muller-bridge-engineer-2006","v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-wiki-seven-mile-bridge"]},{"id":"b039-v13-29-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：體外鋼腱張拉完成後力量不會改變，所以不需要再量測。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Once stressed, an external tendon's force never changes, so it need not be measured again. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v13s-asbi-segmental-construction","v13s-pci-bang-na-2000","v13s-pci-muller-bridge-engineer-2006","v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-wiki-seven-mile-bridge"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「體外鋼腱力量的驗收量測」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Acceptance measurement of external tendon force\" is correct?","options":["體外鋼腱張拉完成後力量不會改變，所以不需要再量測。","體外鋼腱有 HDPE 套管保護，所以不會腐蝕。","體外鋼腱在轉向塊之間是一段自由的張緊索，它的橫向自然頻率與張力直接相關，因此可以在張拉後以加速度計輕敲量測頻率，反算每一束的有效力，作為千斤頂讀值與伸長量之外的第三種獨立驗證。"],"optionsEn":["Once stressed, an external tendon's force never changes, so it need not be measured again.","External tendons in HDPE sheaths cannot corrode.","Between deviators an external tendon is a free taut cable whose lateral natural frequency relates directly to its tension, so after stressing a light tap and an accelerometer give the frequency and hence the effective force of every tendon, a third independent check beyond jack readings and elongation."],"answer":2,"explanation":"體外鋼腱在轉向塊之間是一段自由的張緊索，它的橫向自然頻率與張力直接相關，因此可以在張拉後以加速度計輕敲量測頻率，反算每一束的有效力，作為千斤頂讀值與伸長量之外的第三種獨立驗證。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Between deviators an external tendon is a free taut cable whose lateral natural frequency relates directly to its tension, so after stressing a light tap and an accelerometer give the frequency and hence the effective force of every tendon, a third independent check beyond jack readings and elongation. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":8,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":29},{"id":"b039-v13-30","title":"體外鋼腱力量的驗收量測：定量估算","titleEn":"Acceptance measurement of external tendon force: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-asbi-segmental-construction","v13s-pci-bang-na-2000","v13s-pci-muller-bridge-engineer-2006","v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-wiki-seven-mile-bridge"],"prerequisiteIds":["b039-v13-29"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「體外鋼腱振動頻率」的關鍵量，並判斷跨度、荷載、溫度或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “External tendon vibration frequency” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when span, load, temperature or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：張緊弦 T = 4·m·L²·f²。鋼腱含套管與灌漿 m = 31 kg/m、自由長 L = 10 m，實測基頻 f = 17.0 Hz：T = 4×31×10²×17.0² ≈ 3,584 kN，與設計有效力 3,600 kN 相差約 −0.4%。若頻率降為 16.0 Hz，T ≈ 3,174 kN，即損失約 12%。數值為教學假設。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Taut string T = 4·m·L²·f². For a tendon with sheath and grout m = 31 kg/m, free length L = 10 m and measured fundamental f = 17.0 Hz, T = 4×31×10²×17.0² ≈ 3,584 kN, about −0.4% from the 3,600 kN design effective force. A frequency of 16.0 Hz would give T ≈ 3,174 kN, a loss of about 12%. Values are teaching assumptions. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：對每一跨所有體外鋼腱量測頻率並換算張力，與張拉紀錄比較；同一跨內各束差異超過設定門檻（例如 ±5%）時，以舉離試驗或補充量測確認，並把頻率基準值寫入竣工資料，供日後定期檢查比對。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Measure frequencies of all external tendons in each span and convert them to forces, compare with the stressing records, and if tendons in a span differ by more than a set threshold, for example ±5%, confirm by lift-off or further measurement; record baseline frequencies in the as-built file for later periodic comparison.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b039-v13-30-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"張緊弦 T = 4·m·L²·f²。鋼腱含套管與灌漿 m = 31 kg/m、自由長 L = 10 m，實測基頻 f = 17.0 Hz：T = 4×31×10²×17.0² ≈ 3,584 kN，與設計有效力 3,600 kN 相差約 −0.4%。若頻率降為 16.0 Hz，T ≈ 3,174 kN，即損失約 12%。數值為教學假設。","textEn":"Taut string T = 4·m·L²·f². For a tendon with sheath and grout m = 31 kg/m, free length L = 10 m and measured fundamental f = 17.0 Hz, T = 4×31×10²×17.0² ≈ 3,584 kN, about −0.4% from the 3,600 kN design effective force. A frequency of 16.0 Hz would give T ≈ 3,174 kN, a loss of about 12%. Values are teaching assumptions.","sourceIds":["v13s-asbi-segmental-construction","v13s-pci-bang-na-2000","v13s-pci-muller-bridge-engineer-2006","v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-wiki-seven-mile-bridge"]},{"id":"b039-v13-30-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v13s-asbi-segmental-construction","v13s-pci-bang-na-2000","v13s-pci-muller-bridge-engineer-2006","v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-wiki-seven-mile-bridge"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「體外鋼腱力量的驗收量測」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Acceptance measurement of external tendon force\", which statement holds?","options":["張緊弦 T = 4·m·L²·f²。","逐跨架設的節塊接縫在營運時可以像鋼筋混凝土一樣容許開裂。","乾接縫只是少塗一層環氧，結構行為與環氧接縫完全相同。"],"optionsEn":["Taut string T = 4·m·L²·f².","Joints in span-by-span segmental spans may crack in service just like reinforced concrete.","A dry joint is just an epoxy joint without the epoxy and behaves identically."],"answer":0,"explanation":"張緊弦 T = 4·m·L²·f²。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Taut string T = 4·m·L²·f². Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":8,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":30},{"id":"b039-v13-31","title":"體外鋼腱力量的驗收量測：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Acceptance measurement of external tendon force: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-asbi-segmental-construction","v13s-pci-bang-na-2000","v13s-pci-muller-bridge-engineer-2006","v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-wiki-seven-mile-bridge"],"prerequisiteIds":["b039-v13-30"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「體外鋼腱振動頻率」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “External tendon vibration frequency” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"對每一跨所有體外鋼腱量測頻率並換算張力，與張拉紀錄比較；同一跨內各束差異超過設定門檻（例如 ±5%）時，以舉離試驗或補充量測確認，並把頻率基準值寫入竣工資料，供日後定期檢查比對。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Measure frequencies of all external tendons in each span and convert them to forces, compare with the stressing records, and if tendons in a span differ by more than a set threshold, for example ±5%, confirm by lift-off or further measurement; record baseline frequencies in the as-built file for later periodic comparison. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：竣工資料要以表格列出每一束鋼腱的編號、張拉力、伸長量、量測頻率與換算張力，並說明量測時的溫度與校正方法，讓維護單位能用同一方法重測。","observationEn":"Site practice: As-built records should tabulate every tendon's number, jacking force, elongation, measured frequency and derived force, with the temperature and calibration method, so the maintenance team can repeat the same measurement.","failure":"注意干擾：若只用千斤頂讀值驗收而不量測個別鋼腱，某一束錨具滑絲或夾片未咬合的問題可能被掩蓋，日後該束力量明顯偏低，接縫殘餘壓應力不足而開始張開。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、日照與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: Accepting only on jack readings, without measuring individual tendons, can hide a tendon whose strands slipped or whose wedges did not bite, leaving it well below force so that joint residual compression falls short and joints begin to open. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, sunshine and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b039-v13-31-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"對每一跨所有體外鋼腱量測頻率並換算張力，與張拉紀錄比較；同一跨內各束差異超過設定門檻（例如 ±5%）時，以舉離試驗或補充量測確認，並把頻率基準值寫入竣工資料，供日後定期檢查比對。","textEn":"Measure frequencies of all external tendons in each span and convert them to forces, compare with the stressing records, and if tendons in a span differ by more than a set threshold, for example ±5%, confirm by lift-off or further measurement; record baseline frequencies in the as-built file for later periodic comparison.","sourceIds":["v13s-asbi-segmental-construction","v13s-pci-bang-na-2000","v13s-pci-muller-bridge-engineer-2006","v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-wiki-seven-mile-bridge"]},{"id":"b039-v13-31-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"竣工資料要以表格列出每一束鋼腱的編號、張拉力、伸長量、量測頻率與換算張力，並說明量測時的溫度與校正方法，讓維護單位能用同一方法重測。","textEn":"As-built records should tabulate every tendon's number, jacking force, elongation, measured frequency and derived force, with the temperature and calibration method, so the maintenance team can repeat the same measurement.","sourceIds":["v13s-asbi-segmental-construction","v13s-pci-bang-na-2000","v13s-pci-muller-bridge-engineer-2006","v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-wiki-seven-mile-bridge"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「體外鋼腱力量的驗收量測」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Acceptance measurement of external tendon force\"?","options":["沿用另一座橋或另一棟建築的量測結果，就可視為本工程已完成驗證。","對每一跨所有體外鋼腱量測頻率並換算張力，與張拉紀錄比較。","架橋機本身很重，所以推進時不可能傾覆。"],"optionsEn":["Reusing results from another bridge or building counts as verifying this structure.","Measure frequencies of all external tendons in each span and convert them to forces, compare with the stressing records, and if tendons in a span differ by more than a set threshold, for example ±5%, confirm by lift-off or further measurement.","A gantry is so heavy that it cannot overturn while launching."],"answer":1,"explanation":"對每一跨所有體外鋼腱量測頻率並換算張力，與張拉紀錄比較；同一跨內各束差異超過設定門檻（例如 ±5%）時，以舉離試驗或補充量測確認，並把頻率基準值寫入竣工資料，供日後定期檢查比對。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Measure frequencies of all external tendons in each span and convert them to forces, compare with the stressing records, and if tendons in a span differ by more than a set threshold, for example ±5%, confirm by lift-off or further measurement; record baseline frequencies in the as-built file for later periodic comparison. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":8,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":31},{"id":"b039-v13-32","title":"體外鋼腱力量的驗收量測：失效診斷","titleEn":"Acceptance measurement of external tendon force: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-asbi-segmental-construction","v13s-pci-bang-na-2000","v13s-pci-muller-bridge-engineer-2006","v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-wiki-seven-mile-bridge"],"prerequisiteIds":["b039-v13-31"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「體外鋼腱振動頻率」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “External tendon vibration frequency” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"若只用千斤頂讀值驗收而不量測個別鋼腱，某一束錨具滑絲或夾片未咬合的問題可能被掩蓋，日後該束力量明顯偏低，接縫殘餘壓應力不足而開始張開。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"Accepting only on jack readings, without measuring individual tendons, can hide a tendon whose strands slipped or whose wedges did not bite, leaving it well below force so that joint residual compression falls short and joints begin to open. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：量測需考慮套管與灌漿質量、端部約束與鋼腱抗彎勁度的影響，最好先以舉離試驗校正。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: The measurement must account for the mass of sheath and grout, end restraint and tendon bending stiffness, ideally calibrated first by a lift-off test.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「體外鋼腱張拉完成後力量不會改變，所以不需要再量測。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Once stressed, an external tendon's force never changes, so it need not be measured again.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b039-v13-32-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"若只用千斤頂讀值驗收而不量測個別鋼腱，某一束錨具滑絲或夾片未咬合的問題可能被掩蓋，日後該束力量明顯偏低，接縫殘餘壓應力不足而開始張開。","textEn":"Accepting only on jack readings, without measuring individual tendons, can hide a tendon whose strands slipped or whose wedges did not bite, leaving it well below force so that joint residual compression falls short and joints begin to open.","sourceIds":["v13s-asbi-segmental-construction","v13s-pci-bang-na-2000","v13s-pci-muller-bridge-engineer-2006","v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-wiki-seven-mile-bridge"]},{"id":"b039-v13-32-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v13s-asbi-segmental-construction","v13s-pci-bang-na-2000","v13s-pci-muller-bridge-engineer-2006","v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-wiki-seven-mile-bridge"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「體外鋼腱力量的驗收量測」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Acceptance measurement of external tendon force\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["補一層塗料或放寬允收值，就能解決大多數劣化問題。","體外鋼腱有 HDPE 套管保護，所以不會腐蝕。","若只用千斤頂讀值驗收而不量測個別鋼腱，某一束錨具滑絲或夾片未咬合的問題可能被掩蓋，日後該束力量明顯偏低，接縫殘餘壓應力不足而開始張開。"],"optionsEn":["Adding a coat of paint or widening the acceptance limits solves most deterioration problems.","External tendons in HDPE sheaths cannot corrode.","Accepting only on jack readings, without measuring individual tendons, can hide a tendon whose strands slipped or whose wedges did not bite, leaving it well below force so that joint residual compression falls short and joints begin to open."],"answer":2,"explanation":"若只用千斤頂讀值驗收而不量測個別鋼腱，某一束錨具滑絲或夾片未咬合的問題可能被掩蓋，日後該束力量明顯偏低，接縫殘餘壓應力不足而開始張開。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Accepting only on jack readings, without measuring individual tendons, can hide a tendon whose strands slipped or whose wedges did not bite, leaving it well below force so that joint residual compression falls short and joints begin to open. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":8,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":32}],"order":4},{"id":"b039-v13-s5","title":"耐久、維護與工程交接","titleEn":"Durability, maintenance and engineering handoff","description":"本階段聚焦「體外鋼腱防蝕與可更換設計」與「接縫行為監測與工程交接」：先建立傳力機制與定量模型，再設計試驗驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"Corrosion protection and replaceability of external tendons\" and \"Joint behaviour monitoring and handover\": build the load path and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"b039-v13-33","title":"體外鋼腱防蝕與可更換設計：機制與傳力路徑","titleEn":"Corrosion protection and replaceability of external tendons: mechanism and load path","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-asbi-segmental-construction","v13s-pci-bang-na-2000","v13s-pci-muller-bridge-engineer-2006","v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-wiki-seven-mile-bridge"],"prerequisiteIds":["b039-v13-32"],"objective":"說明「斷束後接縫殘餘壓應力」如何影響橋梁逐跨預鑄節塊架設的受力、變形或耐久表現，並畫出荷載的來源、傳遞路徑與支承邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Joint compression after tendon loss” governs force, deformation or durability in “Span-by-span precast bridge erection”, and map where loads come from, how they travel and where they are supported.","instruction":"體外鋼腱的優點是看得到、可更換，但它的防蝕完全依賴 HDPE 套管、灌漿或填充材與錨頭保護蓋；套管破裂或灌漿有空洞時，水分與氯離子會在低點積聚，鋼絞線可在多年內腐蝕斷裂。1990 年代末至 2000 年前後，佛州數座分段橋的體外鋼腱曾因灌漿空洞與滲水而發現斷束，促成灌漿材料與施工規範的全面修訂。設計時必須假設某一束可能失效或需要更換，檢查其餘鋼腱是否仍能維持接縫受壓。 師傅任務：以自由體圖或傳力路徑圖畫出荷載如何經過「斷束後接縫殘餘壓應力」傳到支承或基礎，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"External tendons are visible and replaceable, but their corrosion protection depends entirely on the HDPE sheath, the grout or filler and the anchor caps; with a cracked sheath or grout voids, water and chlorides collect at low points and strands can corrode and break within years. Around the late 1990s and 2000, failed external tendons were found in several Florida segmental bridges with grout voids and water ingress, prompting broad revisions of grout materials and construction specifications. Design must assume that any one tendon may fail or need replacing and check that the rest still keep the joints in compression. Mentor task: draw a free-body or load-path diagram showing how loads pass through “Joint compression after tendon loss” to the supports or foundation, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：12 束時底緣應力：P/A = 43,200/7.2 = 6,000 kPa、Pe/S_b = 10,800 kPa、自重與鋪面 −12,679 kPa，殘餘 4,121 kPa，消壓活載彎矩 4,121×4.0 ≈ 16,485 kN·m > 12,000。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: With 12 tendons the bottom-fibre stresses are P/A = 43,200/7.2 = 6,000 kPa, Pe/S_b = 10,800 kPa and −12,679 kPa from self-weight and surfacing, leaving 4,121 kPa, so the live-load decompression moment is 4,121×4.0 ≈ 16,485 kN·m > 12,000.","failure":"常見誤解：「體外鋼腱有 HDPE 套管保護，所以不會腐蝕。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在傳力圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"External tendons in HDPE sheaths cannot corrode.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your load-path diagram where it breaks down.","check":"傳力圖標明「斷束後接縫殘餘壓應力」的荷載來源、傳遞路徑與支承；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The load-path diagram shows load sources, path and supports for “Joint compression after tendon loss”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b039-v13-33-k1","title":"體外鋼腱防蝕與可更換設計","titleEn":"Corrosion protection and replaceability of external tendons","text":"體外鋼腱的優點是看得到、可更換，但它的防蝕完全依賴 HDPE 套管、灌漿或填充材與錨頭保護蓋；套管破裂或灌漿有空洞時，水分與氯離子會在低點積聚，鋼絞線可在多年內腐蝕斷裂。1990 年代末至 2000 年前後，佛州數座分段橋的體外鋼腱曾因灌漿空洞與滲水而發現斷束，促成灌漿材料與施工規範的全面修訂。","textEn":"External tendons are visible and replaceable, but their corrosion protection depends entirely on the HDPE sheath, the grout or filler and the anchor caps; with a cracked sheath or grout voids, water and chlorides collect at low points and strands can corrode and break within years. Around the late 1990s and 2000, failed external tendons were found in several Florida segmental bridges with grout voids and water ingress, prompting broad revisions of grout materials and construction specifications.","sourceIds":["v13s-asbi-segmental-construction","v13s-pci-bang-na-2000","v13s-pci-muller-bridge-engineer-2006","v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-wiki-seven-mile-bridge"]},{"id":"b039-v13-33-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：體外鋼腱有 HDPE 套管保護，所以不會腐蝕。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: External tendons in HDPE sheaths cannot corrode. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v13s-asbi-segmental-construction","v13s-pci-bang-na-2000","v13s-pci-muller-bridge-engineer-2006","v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-wiki-seven-mile-bridge"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「體外鋼腱防蝕與可更換設計」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Corrosion protection and replaceability of external tendons\" is correct?","options":["體外鋼腱的優點是看得到、可更換，但它的防蝕完全依賴 HDPE 套管、灌漿或填充材與錨頭保護蓋。","體外鋼腱有 HDPE 套管保護，所以不會腐蝕。","接縫出現滲水只是防水問題，與結構無關。"],"optionsEn":["External tendons are visible and replaceable, but their corrosion protection depends entirely on the HDPE sheath, the grout or filler and the anchor caps.","External tendons in HDPE sheaths cannot corrode.","Water seeping at a segment joint is only a waterproofing issue with no structural meaning."],"answer":0,"explanation":"體外鋼腱的優點是看得到、可更換，但它的防蝕完全依賴 HDPE 套管、灌漿或填充材與錨頭保護蓋；套管破裂或灌漿有空洞時，水分與氯離子會在低點積聚，鋼絞線可在多年內腐蝕斷裂。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"External tendons are visible and replaceable, but their corrosion protection depends entirely on the HDPE sheath, the grout or filler and the anchor caps; with a cracked sheath or grout voids, water and chlorides collect at low points and strands can corrode and break within years. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":9,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":33},{"id":"b039-v13-34","title":"體外鋼腱防蝕與可更換設計：定量估算","titleEn":"Corrosion protection and replaceability of external tendons: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-asbi-segmental-construction","v13s-pci-bang-na-2000","v13s-pci-muller-bridge-engineer-2006","v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-wiki-seven-mile-bridge"],"prerequisiteIds":["b039-v13-33"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「斷束後接縫殘餘壓應力」的關鍵量，並判斷跨度、荷載、溫度或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Joint compression after tendon loss” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when span, load, temperature or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：12 束時底緣應力：P/A = 43,200/7.2 = 6,000 kPa、Pe/S_b = 10,800 kPa、自重與鋪面 −12,679 kPa，殘餘 4,121 kPa，消壓活載彎矩 4,121×4.0 ≈ 16,485 kN·m > 12,000。若少 1 束（39,600 kN），殘餘降為 2,721 kPa，消壓彎矩約 10,885 kN·m \u003c 12,000，滿載時接縫會張開。數值為教學假設。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: With 12 tendons the bottom-fibre stresses are P/A = 43,200/7.2 = 6,000 kPa, Pe/S_b = 10,800 kPa and −12,679 kPa from self-weight and surfacing, leaving 4,121 kPa, so the live-load decompression moment is 4,121×4.0 ≈ 16,485 kN·m > 12,000. With one tendon lost (39,600 kN) the residual falls to 2,721 kPa and the decompression moment to about 10,885 kN·m \u003c 12,000, so joints open under full live load. Values are teaching assumptions. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：竣工前以內視鏡或敲擊抽查錨頭後方與低點的灌漿飽滿度，檢查套管接頭、熱熔焊口與錨頭保護蓋；更換程序的可行性（千斤頂空間、錨碇拆除與鋼腱抽出路徑）在交接前以實際尺寸確認一次。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Before completion, spot-check grout fullness behind anchors and at low points by borescope or sounding, and inspect sheath couplers, fusion welds and anchor caps; confirm the feasibility of the replacement procedure, including jack clearance, anchor removal and tendon withdrawal path, with real dimensions once before handover.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b039-v13-34-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"12 束時底緣應力：P/A = 43,200/7.2 = 6,000 kPa、Pe/S_b = 10,800 kPa、自重與鋪面 −12,679 kPa，殘餘 4,121 kPa，消壓活載彎矩 4,121×4.0 ≈ 16,485 kN·m > 12,000。若少 1 束（39,600 kN），殘餘降為 2,721 kPa，消壓彎矩約 10,885 kN·m \u003c 12,000，滿載時接縫會張開。數值為教學假設。","textEn":"With 12 tendons the bottom-fibre stresses are P/A = 43,200/7.2 = 6,000 kPa, Pe/S_b = 10,800 kPa and −12,679 kPa from self-weight and surfacing, leaving 4,121 kPa, so the live-load decompression moment is 4,121×4.0 ≈ 16,485 kN·m > 12,000. With one tendon lost (39,600 kN) the residual falls to 2,721 kPa and the decompression moment to about 10,885 kN·m \u003c 12,000, so joints open under full live load. Values are teaching assumptions.","sourceIds":["v13s-asbi-segmental-construction","v13s-pci-bang-na-2000","v13s-pci-muller-bridge-engineer-2006","v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-wiki-seven-mile-bridge"]},{"id":"b039-v13-34-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v13s-asbi-segmental-construction","v13s-pci-bang-na-2000","v13s-pci-muller-bridge-engineer-2006","v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-wiki-seven-mile-bridge"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「體外鋼腱防蝕與可更換設計」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Corrosion protection and replaceability of external tendons\", which statement holds?","options":["架橋機的荷重只是暫時的，橋墩照營運荷載設計就足夠。","12 束時底緣應力：P/A = 43,200/7.2 = 6,000 kPa、Pe/S_b = 10,800 kPa、自重與鋪面 −12,679 kPa，殘餘 4,121 kPa，消壓活載彎矩 4,121×4.0 ≈ 16,485 kN·m > 12,000。","體外鋼腱不埋在混凝土裡，所以轉向塊只需要很少的鋼筋。"],"optionsEn":["Gantry loads are only temporary, so piers designed for service loads are always sufficient.","With 12 tendons the bottom-fibre stresses are P/A = 43,200/7.2 = 6,000 kPa, Pe/S_b = 10,800 kPa and −12,679 kPa from self-weight and surfacing, leaving 4,121 kPa, so the live-load decompression moment is 4,121×4.0 ≈ 16,485 kN·m > 12,000.","Because external tendons are not embedded, deviators need very little reinforcement."],"answer":1,"explanation":"12 束時底緣應力：P/A = 43,200/7.2 = 6,000 kPa、Pe/S_b = 10,800 kPa、自重與鋪面 −12,679 kPa，殘餘 4,121 kPa，消壓活載彎矩 4,121×4.0 ≈ 16,485 kN·m > 12,000。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"With 12 tendons the bottom-fibre stresses are P/A = 43,200/7.2 = 6,000 kPa, Pe/S_b = 10,800 kPa and −12,679 kPa from self-weight and surfacing, leaving 4,121 kPa, so the live-load decompression moment is 4,121×4.0 ≈ 16,485 kN·m > 12,000. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":9,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":34},{"id":"b039-v13-35","title":"體外鋼腱防蝕與可更換設計：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Corrosion protection and replaceability of external tendons: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-asbi-segmental-construction","v13s-pci-bang-na-2000","v13s-pci-muller-bridge-engineer-2006","v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-wiki-seven-mile-bridge"],"prerequisiteIds":["b039-v13-34"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「斷束後接縫殘餘壓應力」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Joint compression after tendon loss” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"竣工前以內視鏡或敲擊抽查錨頭後方與低點的灌漿飽滿度，檢查套管接頭、熱熔焊口與錨頭保護蓋；更換程序的可行性（千斤頂空間、錨碇拆除與鋼腱抽出路徑）在交接前以實際尺寸確認一次。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Before completion, spot-check grout fullness behind anchors and at low points by borescope or sounding, and inspect sheath couplers, fusion welds and anchor caps; confirm the feasibility of the replacement procedure, including jack clearance, anchor removal and tendon withdrawal path, with real dimensions once before handover. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：設計須檢核任一束鋼腱失效或更換時的接縫狀態並規定更換期間的交通限制；採購規格要求經認證的預力系統與灌漿材料，灌漿作業由合格人員執行並保留逐束紀錄。","observationEn":"Site practice: Design must check joint behaviour with any one tendon lost or under replacement and state the traffic restrictions during replacement; procurement requires certified post-tensioning systems and grout, with grouting by qualified personnel and records kept tendon by tendon.","failure":"注意干擾：箱內排水不良使雨水在錨碇橫隔前積存，錨頭保護蓋與套管接頭長期泡水，鋼絞線在錨具後方腐蝕斷裂；若設計沒有考慮單束失效，斷束後接縫殘餘壓應力不足，整跨必須限載直到更換完成。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、日照與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: Poor box drainage lets rainwater pond in front of anchorage diaphragms so anchor caps and sheath joints sit in water for years and strands corrode and break behind the anchors; if design did not consider single-tendon loss, the remaining joint compression is insufficient and the whole span must be load-restricted until replacement. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, sunshine and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b039-v13-35-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"竣工前以內視鏡或敲擊抽查錨頭後方與低點的灌漿飽滿度，檢查套管接頭、熱熔焊口與錨頭保護蓋；更換程序的可行性（千斤頂空間、錨碇拆除與鋼腱抽出路徑）在交接前以實際尺寸確認一次。","textEn":"Before completion, spot-check grout fullness behind anchors and at low points by borescope or sounding, and inspect sheath couplers, fusion welds and anchor caps; confirm the feasibility of the replacement procedure, including jack clearance, anchor removal and tendon withdrawal path, with real dimensions once before handover.","sourceIds":["v13s-asbi-segmental-construction","v13s-pci-bang-na-2000","v13s-pci-muller-bridge-engineer-2006","v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-wiki-seven-mile-bridge"]},{"id":"b039-v13-35-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"設計須檢核任一束鋼腱失效或更換時的接縫狀態並規定更換期間的交通限制；採購規格要求經認證的預力系統與灌漿材料，灌漿作業由合格人員執行並保留逐束紀錄。","textEn":"Design must check joint behaviour with any one tendon lost or under replacement and state the traffic restrictions during replacement; procurement requires certified post-tensioning systems and grout, with grouting by qualified personnel and records kept tendon by tendon.","sourceIds":["v13s-asbi-segmental-construction","v13s-pci-bang-na-2000","v13s-pci-muller-bridge-engineer-2006","v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-wiki-seven-mile-bridge"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「體外鋼腱防蝕與可更換設計」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Corrosion protection and replaceability of external tendons\"?","options":["只看一次讀值或外觀即可判定合格，不需要基準點、參考試體或重複量測。","張拉完成後只要拆除吊桿，荷重自然會平均傳到四個支承。","竣工前以內視鏡或敲擊抽查錨頭後方與低點的灌漿飽滿度，檢查套管接頭、熱熔焊口與錨頭保護蓋。"],"optionsEn":["A single reading or a visual impression is enough to accept the work; no datum, reference specimen or repeat measurement is needed.","After stressing, removing the hangers automatically shares the load equally among the four bearings.","Before completion, spot-check grout fullness behind anchors and at low points by borescope or sounding, and inspect sheath couplers, fusion welds and anchor caps."],"answer":2,"explanation":"竣工前以內視鏡或敲擊抽查錨頭後方與低點的灌漿飽滿度，檢查套管接頭、熱熔焊口與錨頭保護蓋；更換程序的可行性（千斤頂空間、錨碇拆除與鋼腱抽出路徑）在交接前以實際尺寸確認一次。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Before completion, spot-check grout fullness behind anchors and at low points by borescope or sounding, and inspect sheath couplers, fusion welds and anchor caps; confirm the feasibility of the replacement procedure, including jack clearance, anchor removal and tendon withdrawal path, with real dimensions once before handover. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":9,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":35},{"id":"b039-v13-36","title":"體外鋼腱防蝕與可更換設計：失效診斷","titleEn":"Corrosion protection and replaceability of external tendons: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-asbi-segmental-construction","v13s-pci-bang-na-2000","v13s-pci-muller-bridge-engineer-2006","v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-wiki-seven-mile-bridge"],"prerequisiteIds":["b039-v13-35"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「斷束後接縫殘餘壓應力」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Joint compression after tendon loss” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"箱內排水不良使雨水在錨碇橫隔前積存，錨頭保護蓋與套管接頭長期泡水，鋼絞線在錨具後方腐蝕斷裂；若設計沒有考慮單束失效，斷束後接縫殘餘壓應力不足，整跨必須限載直到更換完成。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"Poor box drainage lets rainwater pond in front of anchorage diaphragms so anchor caps and sheath joints sit in water for years and strands corrode and break behind the anchors; if design did not consider single-tendon loss, the remaining joint compression is insufficient and the whole span must be load-restricted until replacement. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：設計時必須假設某一束可能失效或需要更換，檢查其餘鋼腱是否仍能維持接縫受壓。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Design must assume that any one tendon may fail or need replacing and check that the rest still keep the joints in compression.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「體外鋼腱有 HDPE 套管保護，所以不會腐蝕。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"External tendons in HDPE sheaths cannot corrode.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b039-v13-36-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"箱內排水不良使雨水在錨碇橫隔前積存，錨頭保護蓋與套管接頭長期泡水，鋼絞線在錨具後方腐蝕斷裂；若設計沒有考慮單束失效，斷束後接縫殘餘壓應力不足，整跨必須限載直到更換完成。","textEn":"Poor box drainage lets rainwater pond in front of anchorage diaphragms so anchor caps and sheath joints sit in water for years and strands corrode and break behind the anchors; if design did not consider single-tendon loss, the remaining joint compression is insufficient and the whole span must be load-restricted until replacement.","sourceIds":["v13s-asbi-segmental-construction","v13s-pci-bang-na-2000","v13s-pci-muller-bridge-engineer-2006","v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-wiki-seven-mile-bridge"]},{"id":"b039-v13-36-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v13s-asbi-segmental-construction","v13s-pci-bang-na-2000","v13s-pci-muller-bridge-engineer-2006","v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-wiki-seven-mile-bridge"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「體外鋼腱防蝕與可更換設計」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Corrosion protection and replaceability of external tendons\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["箱內排水不良使雨水在錨碇橫隔前積存，錨頭保護蓋與套管接頭長期泡水，鋼絞線在錨具後方腐蝕斷裂。","裂縫或異常只出現一次就可以忽略，不需要記錄或追蹤。","接縫出現滲水只是防水問題，與結構無關。"],"optionsEn":["Poor box drainage lets rainwater pond in front of anchorage diaphragms so anchor caps and sheath joints sit in water for years and strands corrode and break behind the anchors.","A crack or anomaly that appears only once can be ignored without logging or follow-up.","Water seeping at a segment joint is only a waterproofing issue with no structural meaning."],"answer":0,"explanation":"箱內排水不良使雨水在錨碇橫隔前積存，錨頭保護蓋與套管接頭長期泡水，鋼絞線在錨具後方腐蝕斷裂；若設計沒有考慮單束失效，斷束後接縫殘餘壓應力不足，整跨必須限載直到更換完成。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Poor box drainage lets rainwater pond in front of anchorage diaphragms so anchor caps and sheath joints sit in water for years and strands corrode and break behind the anchors; if design did not consider single-tendon loss, the remaining joint compression is insufficient and the whole span must be load-restricted until replacement. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":9,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":36},{"id":"b039-v13-37","title":"接縫行為監測與工程交接：機制與傳力路徑","titleEn":"Joint behaviour monitoring and handover: mechanism and load path","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-asbi-segmental-construction","v13s-pci-bang-na-2000","v13s-pci-muller-bridge-engineer-2006","v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-wiki-seven-mile-bridge"],"prerequisiteIds":["b039-v13-36"],"objective":"說明「接縫監測基準」如何影響橋梁逐跨預鑄節塊架設的受力、變形或耐久表現，並畫出荷載的來源、傳遞路徑與支承邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Joint monitoring baseline” governs force, deformation or durability in “Span-by-span precast bridge erection”, and map where loads come from, how they travel and where they are supported.","instruction":"逐跨預鑄橋的健康狀態主要反映在接縫：只要接縫保持受壓，梁體就近似一根完整的預力梁；接縫一旦在活載下張開，底緣應變會出現非線性跳增，接縫處的位移計會讀到開口。因此交接時應在代表性跨的跨中接縫裝設應變計與位移計，以已知重量的車輛做一次基準量測，日後定期重測比較，就能判斷預力是否流失或接縫是否開始呼吸。 師傅任務：以自由體圖或傳力路徑圖畫出荷載如何經過「接縫監測基準」傳到支承或基礎，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"The health of a span-by-span precast bridge shows mainly at its joints: as long as they stay in compression the girder behaves like a monolithic prestressed beam, but once a joint opens under live load the bottom-fibre strain jumps non-linearly and a displacement gauge across the joint reads an opening. Handover should therefore install strain and displacement gauges at midspan joints of representative spans, take a baseline with vehicles of known weight, and repeat periodically to tell whether prestress has been lost or joints have started to breathe. Mentor task: draw a free-body or load-path diagram showing how loads pass through “Joint monitoring baseline” to the supports or foundation, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：接縫受壓時，活載彎矩 12,000 kN·m 造成底緣應變 ε = M/(S_b·E) = 12,000/(4.0×35×10⁶) ≈ 86 με；若同一載重下量到約 120 με 並伴隨跨接縫位移計讀值，代表接縫已局部張開。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: While the joint stays compressed, a live-load moment of 12,000 kN·m produces a bottom-fibre strain ε = M/(S_b·E) = 12,000/(4.0×35×10⁶) ≈ 86 με; measuring about 120 με under the same load, together with a reading on the gauge across the joint, indicates the joint has partly opened.","failure":"常見誤解：「接縫出現滲水只是防水問題，與結構無關。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在傳力圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Water seeping at a segment joint is only a waterproofing issue with no structural meaning.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your load-path diagram where it breaks down.","check":"傳力圖標明「接縫監測基準」的荷載來源、傳遞路徑與支承；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The load-path diagram shows load sources, path and supports for “Joint monitoring baseline”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b039-v13-37-k1","title":"接縫行為監測與工程交接","titleEn":"Joint behaviour monitoring and handover","text":"逐跨預鑄橋的健康狀態主要反映在接縫：只要接縫保持受壓，梁體就近似一根完整的預力梁；接縫一旦在活載下張開，底緣應變會出現非線性跳增，接縫處的位移計會讀到開口。因此交接時應在代表性跨的跨中接縫裝設應變計與位移計，以已知重量的車輛做一次基準量測，日後定期重測比較，就能判斷預力是否流失或接縫是否開始呼吸。","textEn":"The health of a span-by-span precast bridge shows mainly at its joints: as long as they stay in compression the girder behaves like a monolithic prestressed beam, but once a joint opens under live load the bottom-fibre strain jumps non-linearly and a displacement gauge across the joint reads an opening. Handover should therefore install strain and displacement gauges at midspan joints of representative spans, take a baseline with vehicles of known weight, and repeat periodically to tell whether prestress has been lost or joints have started to breathe.","sourceIds":["v13s-asbi-segmental-construction","v13s-pci-bang-na-2000","v13s-pci-muller-bridge-engineer-2006","v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-wiki-seven-mile-bridge"]},{"id":"b039-v13-37-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：接縫出現滲水只是防水問題，與結構無關。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Water seeping at a segment joint is only a waterproofing issue with no structural meaning. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v13s-asbi-segmental-construction","v13s-pci-bang-na-2000","v13s-pci-muller-bridge-engineer-2006","v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-wiki-seven-mile-bridge"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「接縫行為監測與工程交接」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Joint behaviour monitoring and handover\" is correct?","options":["接縫出現滲水只是防水問題，與結構無關。","逐跨預鑄橋的健康狀態主要反映在接縫：只要接縫保持受壓，梁體就近似一根完整的預力梁；接縫一旦在活載下張開，底緣應變會出現非線性跳增，接縫處的位移計會讀到開口。","逐跨架設的節塊接縫在營運時可以像鋼筋混凝土一樣容許開裂。"],"optionsEn":["Water seeping at a segment joint is only a waterproofing issue with no structural meaning.","The health of a span-by-span precast bridge shows mainly at its joints: as long as they stay in compression the girder behaves like a monolithic prestressed beam, but once a joint opens under live load the bottom-fibre strain jumps non-linearly and a displacement gauge across the joint reads an opening.","Joints in span-by-span segmental spans may crack in service just like reinforced concrete."],"answer":1,"explanation":"逐跨預鑄橋的健康狀態主要反映在接縫：只要接縫保持受壓，梁體就近似一根完整的預力梁；接縫一旦在活載下張開，底緣應變會出現非線性跳增，接縫處的位移計會讀到開口。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"The health of a span-by-span precast bridge shows mainly at its joints: as long as they stay in compression the girder behaves like a monolithic prestressed beam, but once a joint opens under live load the bottom-fibre strain jumps non-linearly and a displacement gauge across the joint reads an opening. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":10,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":37},{"id":"b039-v13-38","title":"接縫行為監測與工程交接：定量估算","titleEn":"Joint behaviour monitoring and handover: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-asbi-segmental-construction","v13s-pci-bang-na-2000","v13s-pci-muller-bridge-engineer-2006","v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-wiki-seven-mile-bridge"],"prerequisiteIds":["b039-v13-37"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「接縫監測基準」的關鍵量，並判斷跨度、荷載、溫度或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Joint monitoring baseline” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when span, load, temperature or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：接縫受壓時，活載彎矩 12,000 kN·m 造成底緣應變 ε = M/(S_b·E) = 12,000/(4.0×35×10⁶) ≈ 86 με；若同一載重下量到約 120 με 並伴隨跨接縫位移計讀值，代表接縫已局部張開。數值為教學假設。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: While the joint stays compressed, a live-load moment of 12,000 kN·m produces a bottom-fibre strain ε = M/(S_b·E) = 12,000/(4.0×35×10⁶) ≈ 86 με; measuring about 120 με under the same load, together with a reading on the gauge across the joint, indicates the joint has partly opened. Values are teaching assumptions. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：基準量測使用已知軸重的試驗車，以慢速與正常速度各通過數次，記錄應變、位移與溫度；量測結果與計算值的比值（量測／計算）應在可解釋範圍內，並將感測器位置、車重與原始資料一併納入交接文件。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: The baseline uses test trucks of known axle loads crossing several times at crawl and normal speed, recording strain, displacement and temperature; the measured-to-calculated ratio must be explainable, and sensor locations, truck weights and raw data go into the handover documents.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b039-v13-38-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"接縫受壓時，活載彎矩 12,000 kN·m 造成底緣應變 ε = M/(S_b·E) = 12,000/(4.0×35×10⁶) ≈ 86 με；若同一載重下量到約 120 με 並伴隨跨接縫位移計讀值，代表接縫已局部張開。數值為教學假設。","textEn":"While the joint stays compressed, a live-load moment of 12,000 kN·m produces a bottom-fibre strain ε = M/(S_b·E) = 12,000/(4.0×35×10⁶) ≈ 86 με; measuring about 120 με under the same load, together with a reading on the gauge across the joint, indicates the joint has partly opened. Values are teaching assumptions.","sourceIds":["v13s-asbi-segmental-construction","v13s-pci-bang-na-2000","v13s-pci-muller-bridge-engineer-2006","v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-wiki-seven-mile-bridge"]},{"id":"b039-v13-38-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v13s-asbi-segmental-construction","v13s-pci-bang-na-2000","v13s-pci-muller-bridge-engineer-2006","v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-wiki-seven-mile-bridge"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「接縫行為監測與工程交接」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Joint behaviour monitoring and handover\", which statement holds?","options":["乾接縫只是少塗一層環氧，結構行為與環氧接縫完全相同。","架橋機本身很重，所以推進時不可能傾覆。","接縫受壓時，活載彎矩 12,000 kN·m 造成底緣應變 ε = M/(S_b·E) = 12,000/(4.0×35×10⁶) ≈ 86 με。"],"optionsEn":["A dry joint is just an epoxy joint without the epoxy and behaves identically.","A gantry is so heavy that it cannot overturn while launching.","While the joint stays compressed, a live-load moment of 12,000 kN·m produces a bottom-fibre strain ε = M/(S_b·E) = 12,000/(4.0×35×10⁶) ≈ 86 με."],"answer":2,"explanation":"接縫受壓時，活載彎矩 12,000 kN·m 造成底緣應變 ε = M/(S_b·E) = 12,000/(4.0×35×10⁶) ≈ 86 με；若同一載重下量到約 120 με 並伴隨跨接縫位移計讀值，代表接縫已局部張開。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"While the joint stays compressed, a live-load moment of 12,000 kN·m produces a bottom-fibre strain ε = M/(S_b·E) = 12,000/(4.0×35×10⁶) ≈ 86 με; measuring about 120 με under the same load, together with a reading on the gauge across the joint, indicates the joint has partly opened. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":10,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":38},{"id":"b039-v13-39","title":"接縫行為監測與工程交接：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Joint behaviour monitoring and handover: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-asbi-segmental-construction","v13s-pci-bang-na-2000","v13s-pci-muller-bridge-engineer-2006","v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-wiki-seven-mile-bridge"],"prerequisiteIds":["b039-v13-38"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「接縫監測基準」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Joint monitoring baseline” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"基準量測使用已知軸重的試驗車，以慢速與正常速度各通過數次，記錄應變、位移與溫度；量測結果與計算值的比值（量測／計算）應在可解釋範圍內，並將感測器位置、車重與原始資料一併納入交接文件。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"The baseline uses test trucks of known axle loads crossing several times at crawl and normal speed, recording strain, displacement and temperature; the measured-to-calculated ratio must be explainable, and sensor locations, truck weights and raw data go into the handover documents. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：交接文件應包含節塊與鋼腱編號對照、預製幾何紀錄、張拉與頻率量測表、接縫監測基準、箱內通行與排水維護計畫，以及鋼腱更換程序；首次定期檢查應在通車約一年內完成。","observationEn":"Site practice: Handover documents should include segment and tendon cross-references, casting geometry records, stressing and frequency tables, the joint monitoring baseline, box access and drainage maintenance plans and the tendon replacement procedure; the first routine inspection should be done within about a year of opening.","failure":"注意干擾：沒有基準資料時，多年後在接縫看到白華或滲水痕跡，也無法判斷是排水問題還是預力流失；等到底板出現沿接縫的明顯開口，往往已有鋼腱斷束，修復代價遠高於早期介入。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、日照與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: Without a baseline, efflorescence or seepage at a joint years later cannot be attributed to drainage or to prestress loss; by the time an obvious opening appears along the bottom slab, tendons have often already failed and repair costs far exceed early intervention. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, sunshine and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b039-v13-39-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"基準量測使用已知軸重的試驗車，以慢速與正常速度各通過數次，記錄應變、位移與溫度；量測結果與計算值的比值（量測／計算）應在可解釋範圍內，並將感測器位置、車重與原始資料一併納入交接文件。","textEn":"The baseline uses test trucks of known axle loads crossing several times at crawl and normal speed, recording strain, displacement and temperature; the measured-to-calculated ratio must be explainable, and sensor locations, truck weights and raw data go into the handover documents.","sourceIds":["v13s-asbi-segmental-construction","v13s-pci-bang-na-2000","v13s-pci-muller-bridge-engineer-2006","v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-wiki-seven-mile-bridge"]},{"id":"b039-v13-39-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"交接文件應包含節塊與鋼腱編號對照、預製幾何紀錄、張拉與頻率量測表、接縫監測基準、箱內通行與排水維護計畫，以及鋼腱更換程序；首次定期檢查應在通車約一年內完成。","textEn":"Handover documents should include segment and tendon cross-references, casting geometry records, stressing and frequency tables, the joint monitoring baseline, box access and drainage maintenance plans and the tendon replacement procedure; the first routine inspection should be done within about a year of opening.","sourceIds":["v13s-asbi-segmental-construction","v13s-pci-bang-na-2000","v13s-pci-muller-bridge-engineer-2006","v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-wiki-seven-mile-bridge"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「接縫行為監測與工程交接」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Joint behaviour monitoring and handover\"?","options":["基準量測使用已知軸重的試驗車，以慢速與正常速度各通過數次，記錄應變、位移與溫度。","不確定度太難估計，報告中只寫最佳值即可。","預製場的模板精度夠高，就不需要逐塊量測幾何。"],"optionsEn":["The baseline uses test trucks of known axle loads crossing several times at crawl and normal speed, recording strain, displacement and temperature.","Uncertainty is too hard to estimate, so the report may state only the best value.","If the yard forms are accurate enough, segment geometry need not be surveyed one by one."],"answer":0,"explanation":"基準量測使用已知軸重的試驗車，以慢速與正常速度各通過數次，記錄應變、位移與溫度；量測結果與計算值的比值（量測／計算）應在可解釋範圍內，並將感測器位置、車重與原始資料一併納入交接文件。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"The baseline uses test trucks of known axle loads crossing several times at crawl and normal speed, recording strain, displacement and temperature; the measured-to-calculated ratio must be explainable, and sensor locations, truck weights and raw data go into the handover documents. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":10,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":39},{"id":"b039-v13-40","title":"接縫行為監測與工程交接：失效診斷","titleEn":"Joint behaviour monitoring and handover: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-asbi-segmental-construction","v13s-pci-bang-na-2000","v13s-pci-muller-bridge-engineer-2006","v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-wiki-seven-mile-bridge"],"prerequisiteIds":["b039-v13-39"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「接縫監測基準」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Joint monitoring baseline” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"沒有基準資料時，多年後在接縫看到白華或滲水痕跡，也無法判斷是排水問題還是預力流失；等到底板出現沿接縫的明顯開口，往往已有鋼腱斷束，修復代價遠高於早期介入。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"Without a baseline, efflorescence or seepage at a joint years later cannot be attributed to drainage or to prestress loss; by the time an obvious opening appears along the bottom slab, tendons have often already failed and repair costs far exceed early intervention. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：因此交接時應在代表性跨的跨中接縫裝設應變計與位移計，以已知重量的車輛做一次基準量測，日後定期重測比較，就能判斷預力是否流失或接縫是否開始呼吸。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Handover should therefore install strain and displacement gauges at midspan joints of representative spans, take a baseline with vehicles of known weight, and repeat periodically to tell whether prestress has been lost or joints have started to breathe.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「接縫出現滲水只是防水問題，與結構無關。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Water seeping at a segment joint is only a waterproofing issue with no structural meaning.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b039-v13-40-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"沒有基準資料時，多年後在接縫看到白華或滲水痕跡，也無法判斷是排水問題還是預力流失；等到底板出現沿接縫的明顯開口，往往已有鋼腱斷束，修復代價遠高於早期介入。","textEn":"Without a baseline, efflorescence or seepage at a joint years later cannot be attributed to drainage or to prestress loss; by the time an obvious opening appears along the bottom slab, tendons have often already failed and repair costs far exceed early intervention.","sourceIds":["v13s-asbi-segmental-construction","v13s-pci-bang-na-2000","v13s-pci-muller-bridge-engineer-2006","v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-wiki-seven-mile-bridge"]},{"id":"b039-v13-40-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v13s-asbi-segmental-construction","v13s-pci-bang-na-2000","v13s-pci-muller-bridge-engineer-2006","v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-wiki-seven-mile-bridge"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「接縫行為監測與工程交接」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Joint behaviour monitoring and handover\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["先更換最貴的構件；只要症狀消失，就代表已找到根因。","沒有基準資料時，多年後在接縫看到白華或滲水痕跡，也無法判斷是排水問題還是預力流失；等到底板出現沿接縫的明顯開口，往往已有鋼腱斷束，修復代價遠高於早期介入。","逐跨架設的節塊接縫在營運時可以像鋼筋混凝土一樣容許開裂。"],"optionsEn":["Replace the most expensive component first; if the symptom disappears, the root cause has been found.","Without a baseline, efflorescence or seepage at a joint years later cannot be attributed to drainage or to prestress loss.","Joints in span-by-span segmental spans may crack in service just like reinforced concrete."],"answer":1,"explanation":"沒有基準資料時，多年後在接縫看到白華或滲水痕跡，也無法判斷是排水問題還是預力流失；等到底板出現沿接縫的明顯開口，往往已有鋼腱斷束，修復代價遠高於早期介入。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Without a baseline, efflorescence or seepage at a joint years later cannot be attributed to drainage or to prestress loss; by the time an obvious opening appears along the bottom slab, tendons have often already failed and repair costs far exceed early intervention. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":10,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":40}],"order":5}],"sourceIds":["v13s-asbi-segmental-construction","v13s-pci-bang-na-2000","v13s-pci-muller-bridge-engineer-2006","v4-related-012931659edd","v13s-wiki-seven-mile-bridge"],"curriculumVersion":13,"stepCount":40,"estimatedMinutes":1000}};
